os","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manuader/polymarket-bot/commits/a163ec0fedfc36b6bde581244ad5febfec72b17a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T20:09:05Z","email":"adermanu@gmail.com","name":"manuader"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T20:09:05Z","email":"adermanu@gmail.com","name":"manuader"},"message":"fix: critical bugs + efficiency for 1GB VM\n\nCritical:\n- C1: process_signal() now called after signal creation (paper trades were never opened)\n- C2: Anthropic client changed to AsyncAnthropic (was blocking event loop 10-30s)\n- C3: /health endpoint moved before SPA catch-all (was returning index.html)\n\nHigh:\n- H1: Removed unused price_queue (wasted memory)\n- H3: Cleanup now purges volume_snapshots (>48h) and bot_activity (>7d)\n- H4: Coordinated wallets rule limited to 5 API calls max\n- H5: DB pool reduced from 20+10 to 5+3 (saves ~200MB RAM)\n- H6: Fixed dict mutation in trade ingestion loop\n\nEfficiency:\n- E4: Cache eviction for orderbook (max 200) and wallet profiles (max 500)\n- E5: Fixed contradictory CORS config","tree":{"sha":"5dd19e443d272fd6308a5bfb58e5db7a3ef49434","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manuader/polymarket-bot/git/trees/5dd19e443d272fd6308a5bfb58e5db7a3ef49434"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manuader/polymarket-bot/git/commits/a163ec0fedfc36b6bde581244ad5febfec72b17a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93409773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/