rred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manuader/polymarket-bot/commits/cce25924b30f3619e10eac1e8b260b0ee985d85e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T19:20:35Z","email":"adermanu@gmail.com","name":"manuader"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T19:20:35Z","email":"adermanu@gmail.com","name":"manuader"},"message":"fix: detection pipeline — thresholds from .env, diagnostic logging, richer activity feed\n\nRoot cause: rules_config.py had hardcoded $10k thresholds ignoring .env MIN_TRADE_USD=5000.\nAll trades between $5k-$10k were silently blocked. Individual rules also too strict.\n\nFixes:\n- rules_config.py now loads base threshold from settings (.env)\n- All rule thresholds scaled proportionally to MIN_TRADE_USD\n- Relaxed: max_trades 5→20, improbable price 0.15→0.20, consensus 0.80→0.75, spike 3x→2.5x\n- Added diagnostic logging: trades evaluated without hits now logged with reason\n- Activity feed shows each large trade individually with market name, topic, wallet, outcome\n- Frontend ActivityFeed shows outcome color, topic tag, price, side\n- New event types: large_trade, trade_evaluated, signal_resolved","tree":{"sha":"8a7bf9cd983d5c8a7b08da278f53fc2a67ebc8ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manuader/polymarket-bot/git/trees/8a7bf9cd983d5c8a7b08da278f53fc2a67ebc8ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manuader/polymarket-bot/git/commits/cce25924b30f3619e10eac1e8b260b0ee985d85e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93409773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/followers","f