/manuader/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manuader/polymarket-bot/commits/ff4295634ca2ec5b19c0401c4dac96eadd9037eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T22:04:16Z","email":"adermanu@gmail.com","name":"manuader"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T22:04:16Z","email":"adermanu@gmail.com","name":"manuader"},"message":"feat: detection engine — 8 heuristic rules + Claude AI analyzer + signal manager\n\n- 6 rules from SPEC + 2 new (PRICE_REVERSAL_AFTER_SPIKE, BET_AGAINST_CONSENSUS)\n- AI analyzer with Claude Sonnet + web search, 6h cache, 50/day limit\n- Composite scoring: heuristic base + AI adjustment + multi-rule bonus\n- Signal deduplication (4h window per market+type)\n- Configurable thresholds via rules_config.py\n- Falls back to heuristic-only scoring when no API key\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b471038fd0a68cb4ef197b081a9100e0014d92a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manuader/polymarket-bot/git/trees/b471038fd0a68cb4ef197b081a9100e0014d92a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/manuader/polymarket-bot/git/commits/ff4295634ca2ec5b19c0401c4dac96eadd9037eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93409773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manuader/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_