og): visual image prompts + AI-picked style (was comic + heading text)\n\nBlog inline images were weak: blog-image-plan used the section HEADING text as\nthe image prompt (abstract, not a visual scene) and blog-images passed an invalid\nstyle (''single-image'') that fell back to the explainer-comic preset, so images\nlooked like generic comics rather than the real subject. Now blog-image-plan asks\nthe writing model to describe a concrete visual SCENE per slot depicting the real\nsubject (footballers on a pitch, the dish, devices…) grounded in the drafted\ncontent, and to pick a fitting styleId (photo-real default). blog-images forwards\nthat style and drops the heading caption (which nudged text rendering). Generic\nacross topics; blog-only — media-image/image-style and shorts/countryball/image\nflows untouched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a816af887258dbb6c5a11f230fccfc4c19ce5867","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/trees/a816af887258dbb6c5a11f230fccfc4c19ce5867"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/commits/64df9ee79fa2afa7a1a477a8b7758ee4f7724996","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commit/64df9ee79fa2afa7a1a477a8b7758ee4f7724996","node_id":"C_kwDOR9tjMtoAKDY0ZGY5ZWU3OWZhMmFmYTdhMWE0NzdhOGI3NzU4ZWU0Zjc3MjQ5OTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commit/b8480fe4f2d43d77624710833c2b9676a4227acc","sha":"b8480fe4f2d43d77624710833c2b9676a4227acc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/b8480fe4f2d43d77624710833c2b9676a4227acc"}],"sha":"64df9ee79fa2afa7a1a477a8b7758ee4f7724996","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/64df9ee79fa2afa7a1a477a8b7758ee4f7724996"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/b8480fe4f2d43d77624710833c2b9676a4227acc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T01:39:49Z","email":"a0000@0000ui-MacBookPro.local","name":"MINKYUNGWOOK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T01:39:49Z","email":"a0000@0000ui-MacBookPro.local","name":"MINKYUNGWOOK"},"message":"fix(countryball): show \"선택됨\" immediately on angle pick (local echo)\n\nAfter decoupling select from run, the card''s selected badge was driven only by\nthe node OUTPUT, which the click doesn''t change (the choice is persisted to\nconfig). Add a local selected-angle state so the picked card flips to \"선택됨 ✓\"\ninstantly, giving feedback before the user clicks the run button. Countryball-only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b72ebe5bf331a02c9c426d1ab193b557512d1f83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/trees/b72ebe5bf331a02c9c426d1ab193b557512d1f83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/commits/b8480fe4f2d43d77624710833c2b9676a4227acc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commit/b8480fe4f2d43d77624710833c2b9676a4227acc","node_id":"C_kwDOR9tjMtoAKGI4NDgwZmU0ZjJkNDNkNzc2MjQ3MTA4MzNjMmI5Njc2YTQyMjdhY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commit/f3311b7bb81bb029c266544c55cb0b8bfcdea439","sha":"f3311b7bb81bb029c266544c55cb0b8bfcdea439","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/f3311b7bb81bb029c266544c55cb0b8bfcdea439"}],"sha":"b8480fe4f2d43d77624710833c2b9676a4227acc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/b8480fe4f2d43d77624710833c2b9676a4227acc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/f3311b7bb81bb029c266544c55cb0b8bfcdea439/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T01:34:27Z","email":"a0000@0000ui-MacBookPro.local","name":"MINKYUNGWOOK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T01:34:27Z","email":"a0000@0000ui-MacBookPro.local","name":"MINKYUNGWOOK"},"message":"fix(countryball): make angle selection a deliberate step, not auto-run\n\nClicking an angle card immediately fired the writer-brain resume run\n(onCountryballAngleSelect -> onCountryballAngleSelected -> handleRunWorkflow),\nso selecting \"auto-advanced\" past the checkpoint to 작가 설계. Now the card only\npersists the choice (highlights 선택됨); the user advances deliberately via the\nexisting \"선택한 앵글로 작가 설계 실행\" run button. Removed the now-dead\nonCountryballAngleSelected prop chain (NodeBlock/WorkflowCanvas/FlowEditorPage),\nrelabeled the card button to \"N번 선택\", updated the spec. Countryball-only;\nblog/shorts/image flows untouched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b2e826516571f7160d9e406f68e23d650e4f7da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/trees/1b2e826516571f7160d9e406f68e23d650e4f7da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/commits/f3311b7bb81bb029c266544c55cb0b8bfcdea439","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commit/f3311b7bb81bb029c266544c55cb0b8bfcdea439","node_id":"C_kwDOR9tjMtoAKGYzMzExYjdiYjgxYmIwMjljMjY2NTQ0YzU1Y2IwYjhiZmNkZWE0Mzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commit/118d585161f3c61e59bafdb18433c99b8122e187","sha":"118d585161f3c61e59bafdb18433c99b8122e187","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/118d585161f3c61e59bafdb18433c99b8122e187"}],"sha":"f3311b7bb81bb029c266544c55cb0b8bfcdea439","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/f3311b7bb81bb029c266544c55cb0b8bfcdea439"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/118d585161f3c61e59bafdb18433c99b8122e187/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T16:45:00Z","email":"a0000@0000ui-MacBookPro.local","name":"MINKYUNGWOOK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T16:45:00Z","email":"a0000@0000ui-MacBookPro.local","name":"MINKYUNGWOOK"},"message":"fix(blog): correct topic, route blog previews, auto-generate images, fix view-large\n\nFour bugs from a real blog run (\"주제는 대한민국 월드컵 조편성 분석\"):\n- topic: orchestrator took the format word (\"블로그 글\") as the subject. Add\n  deterministic extractStatedSubject (주제는/주제:/about: markers) scoped to the\n  blog branch, plus a decision-prompt rule (surfaceTerms = subject, never format\n  word). Frozen shorts/countryball/image topic path unchanged.\n- preview bleed: intermediate blog nodes rendered the longform preview because\n  isLongformGateARecord matched sections-shape. Route blog by explicit mode\n  (NodeBlock + TooltipContentRenderer); add selectPreviewVariant + intermediate\n  blog summaries. Longform/video/images still route correctly (unit-tested).\n- images: blog defaulted to zero with no prompt. resolveBlogImagePlan now\n  defaults images on (off only on explicit opt-out) with a bounded count\n  (default 4, 1..8); blog-image-plan spreads slots evenly across sections.\n- view-large/sizing: wrap blog output in withModal (크게 보기 was dead), add a\n  blog node-width case, make BlogPreview fluid (w-full, caps at 680 in modal).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4be064920f64ebd6dcc63a55d1c9b01c65d3292e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/trees/4be064920f64ebd6dcc63a55d1c9b01c65d3292e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/commits/118d585161f3c61e59bafdb18433c99b8122e187","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commit/118d585161f3c61e59bafdb18433c99b8122e187","node_id":"C_kwDOR9tjMtoAKDExOGQ1ODUxNjFmM2M2MWU1OWJhZmRiMTg0MzNjOTliODEyMmUxODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commit/989ae1edade5ceae247b9dc8fe2f7314e1360763","sha":"989ae1edade5ceae247b9dc8fe2f7314e1360763","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/989ae1edade5ceae247b9dc8fe2f7314e1360763"}],"sha":"118d585161f3c61e59bafdb18433c99b8122e187","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/118d585161f3c61e59bafdb18433c99b8122e187"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/989ae1edade5ceae247b9dc8fe2f7314e1360763/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T15:40:38Z","email":"a0000@0000ui-MacBookPro.local","name":"MINKYUNGWOOK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T15:40:38Z","email":"a0000@0000ui-MacBookPro.local","name":"MINKYUNGWOOK"},"message":"feat(blog): generalize structure and search to model judgment\n\nblog-brief emits searchQueries (model decides which searches ground the\narticle: one, or several for multi-entity topics). blog-research runs and\nmerges them, deduped — content-type agnostic. blog-outline infers\nstructure from general principles (comparison/howto/review shown as\nillustrations, not a fixed switch). blog-draft stays grounded and honest\nwhen sources are thin. brief/outline/draft now use openaiWritingModel.\nCost estimates updated for mini (blog + longform source/brief/storyboard).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52c1a7ec32c0e90ef7e845791501ddfcd1a54dd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/trees/52c1a7ec32c0e90ef7e845791501ddfcd1a54dd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/commits/989ae1edade5ceae247b9dc8fe2f7314e1360763","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commit/989ae1edade5ceae247b9dc8fe2f7314e1360763","node_id":"C_kwDOR9tjMtoAKDk4OWFlMWVkYWRlNWNlYWUyNDdiOWRjOGZlMmY3MzE0ZTEzNjA3NjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commit/afdb8ace46f8e3bb7abc0183aea1ae190115ab92","sha":"afdb8ace46f8e3bb7abc0183aea1ae190115ab92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/afdb8ace46f8e3bb7abc0183aea1ae190115ab92"}],"sha":"989ae1edade5ceae247b9dc8fe2f7314e1360763","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/989ae1edade5ceae247b9dc8fe2f7314e1360763"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/afdb8ace46f8e3bb7abc0183aea1ae190115ab92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T15:40:09Z","email":"a0000@0000ui-MacBookPro.local","name":"MINKYUNGWOOK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T15:40:09Z","email":"a0000@0000ui-MacBookPro.local","name":"MINKYUNGWOOK"},"message":"feat(blocks): upgrade creative generation nano -> writing model\n\nAdd env.openaiWritingModel (OPENAI_WRITING_MODEL, default gpt-5.4-mini)\nfor prose/script generation. Swap countryball brief/angle-lab/script/\nwriter-brain, shorts content-block, and longform source/brief/storyboard\nonto it. Utility calls (orchestrator, search, vision, seo, longform\nmotion) stay on nano. Frozen-flow logic unchanged: model reference only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a844ff2722a53f5aec8866aa3b5066e42374221a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/trees/a844ff2722a53f5aec8866aa3b5066e42374221a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/commits/afdb8ace46f8e3bb7abc0183aea1ae190115ab92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commit/afdb8ace46f8e3bb7abc0183aea1ae190115ab92","node_id":"C_kwDOR9tjMtoAKGFmZGI4YWNlNDZmOGUzYmI3YWJjMDE4M2FlYTFhZTE5MDExNWFiOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commit/c5351b8713281f424e569b87999916048e154f1f","sha":"c5351b8713281f424e569b87999916048e154f1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/c5351b8713281f424e569b87999916048e154f1f"}],"sha":"afdb8ace46f8e3bb7abc0183aea1ae190115ab92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/afdb8ace46f8e3bb7abc0183aea1ae190115ab92"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/c5351b8713281f424e569b87999916048e154f1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:58:25Z","email":"a0000@0000ui-MacBookPro.local","name":"MINKYUNGWOOK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:58:25Z","email":"a0000@0000ui-MacBookPro.local","name":"MINKYUNGWOOK"},"message":"feat(web): blog naver-style preview + export bar\n\n- BlogPreview: naver-like render (title/hero/H2-H3/paragraphs/inline image+caption/highlight)\n- BlogExportBar: copy-for-naver (text/html + text/plain), copy markdown, image ZIP + fallback\n- consumes blog-assemble previewModel / blog-export naverHtml+markdown+imageManifest\n- wired additively into NodeBlock output preview; i18n ko/en; demo render script\n- OUT: real Naver editor paste = manual acceptance; DetailPanel still raw JSON\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c2cf5d8abb69b2df2a50d0056a3d8cf710464a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/trees/1c2cf5d8abb69b2df2a50d0056a3d8cf710464a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/commits/c5351b8713281f424e569b87999916048e154f1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commit/c5351b8713281f424e569b87999916048e154f1f","node_id":"C_kwDOR9tjMtoAKGM1MzUxYjg3MTMyODFmNDI0ZTU2OWI4Nzk5OTkxNjA0OGUxNTRmMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commit/fa8bb9d03de0d1c1332aadea44cfaaaec0bd51d9","sha":"fa8bb9d03de0d1c1332aadea44cfaaaec0bd51d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/fa8bb9d03de0d1c1332aadea44cfaaaec0bd51d9"}],"sha":"c5351b8713281f424e569b87999916048e154f1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/c5351b8713281f424e569b87999916048e154f1f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/commits/fa8bb9d03de0d1c1332aadea44cfaaaec0bd51d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:20:21Z","email":"a0000@0000ui-MacBookPro.local","name":"MINKYUNGWOOK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T14:20:21Z","email":"a0000@0000ui-MacBookPro.local","name":"MINKYUNGWOOK"},"message":"feat: blog v2 backend — naver-paste pipeline (outline-first + image slots)\n\n- blog pack + 9 blocks: brief>research>outline>draft>image-plan>images>seo>assemble>export\n- BlogDocument contract: sections + image slots(placement) + SEO + facts(source)\n- blog-export emits naverHtml + markdown + imageManifest (not markdown-only)\n- outline selection checkpoint (additive); run-service resume dispatch (countryball verbatim)\n- routes blog writing to text.blog.v2; v1 preserved + selectable\n- anti-hallucination: thread facts/articles outline>draft>image-plan\n- frozen content/media/countryball/longform blocks untouched\n- OUT: frontend preview/clipboard UI + manual Naver paste test\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a384954cd9859bec12e9bc715fb59a3b43f7ffa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/trees/6a384954cd9859bec12e9bc715fb59a3b43f7ffa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hansungMILK/KW-backend/git/commits/fa8bb9d03de0d1c1332aadea44cfaaaec0bd51d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/hansungMILK