":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-Hars/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-Hars/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-Hars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-Hars/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tt-Hars","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-Hars/mf-monorepo/commits/27b196f73e23fc5fe61479802dfd3479b9b7a58c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T16:14:17Z","email":"30545822+tt-Hars@users.noreply.github.com","name":"tt-Hars"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T16:14:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Convert monorepo to TypeScript and migrate splittR to Angular (#2)\n\n* refactor: convert monorepo workspace to TypeScript\n\n- Introduce a workspace-wide `tsconfig.base.json`\n- Migrate VanillaJS `host` app to TypeScript (`ts-loader`), adding relevant TS types (`@types/jsdom`, etc.).\n- Migrate `budgT` React remote from Babel JS to TS/TSX using `@babel/preset-typescript`.\n- Convert `splittR` dummy vanilla app to a native Angular TS workspace configured via `@angular-architects/module-federation` to run seamlessly through the Module Federation entry.\n- Corrected imports, aliases, type declarations, updated the Vitest configuration, and ensured proper bootstrapping and testing across apps.\n\nCo-authored-by: tt-Hars <30545822+tt-Hars@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor: convert monorepo workspace to TypeScript\n\n- Introduce a workspace-wide `tsconfig.base.json`\n- Migrate VanillaJS `host` app to TypeScript (`ts-loader`), adding relevant TS types (`@types/jsdom`, etc.).\n- Migrate `budgT` React remote from Babel JS to TS/TSX using `@babel/preset-typescript`.\n- Convert `splittR` dummy vanilla app to a native Angular TS workspace configured via `@angular-architects/module-federation` to run seamlessly through the Module Federation entry.\n- Corrected imports, aliases, type declarations, updated the Vitest configuration, and ensured proper bootstrapping and testing across apps.\n- Enforce usage of `pnpm` exclusively, removed rogue `package-lock.json` files and updated `SUMMARY.md`.\n\nCo-authored-by: tt-Hars <30545822+tt-Hars@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* refactor: convert monorepo workspace to TypeScript\n\n- Introduce a workspace-wide `tsconfig.base.json`\n- Migrate VanillaJS `host` app to TypeScript (`ts-loader`), adding relevant TS types (`@types/jsdom`, etc.).\n- Migrate `budgT` React remote from Babel JS to TS/TSX using `@babel/preset-typescript`.\n- Convert `splittR` dummy vanilla app to a native Angular TS workspace configured via `@angular-architects/module-federation` to run seamlessly through the Module Federation entry.\n- Corrected imports, aliases, type declarations, updated the Vitest configuration, and ensured proper bootstrapping and testing across apps.\n- Enforce usage of `pnpm` exclusively, removed rogue `package-lock.json` files and updated `SUMMARY.md`.\n\n* working base app\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: google-labs-jules[bot] <161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: h.t. <h.t@t.co>","tree":{"sha":"09b1ba4ca6008c1b53e290ae1a2166d101646085","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-Hars/mf-monorepo/git/trees/09b1ba4ca6008c1b53e290ae1a2166d101646085"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tt-Hars/mf-monorepo/git/commits/27b196f73e23fc5fe61479802dfd3479b9b7a58c","verification":{"payload":"tree 09b1ba4ca6008c1b53e290ae1a2166d101646085\nparent a1307e83a3f3dec3b6b70d2ae236d8beb35fe9c6\nauthor tt-Hars <30545822+tt-Hars@users.noreply.github.com> 1777565657 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777565657 +0530\n\nConvert monorepo to TypeScript and migrate splittR to Angular (#2)\n\n* refactor: convert monorepo workspace to TypeScript\n\n- Introduce a workspace-wide `tsconfig.base.json`\n- Migrate VanillaJS `host` app to TypeScript (`ts-loader`), adding r