rl":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-vpn/commits/5587d9fd6953469fb3c849d83edde30ad4f63cf7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-01T09:01:01Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-01T09:01:01Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"message":"fix: always reset app.current_tenant_id in get_db to prevent connection pool leak\n\nWhen a request without a tenant header reuses a connection from the\npool, the previous request''s app.current_tenant_id persisted. Always\nexecute SET, using an empty string fallback when tenant_id is None,\nto ensure each request starts with a clean RLS variable.","tree":{"sha":"bf1002b43ae1e73c8cd34ddb482aaa303d936a70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-vpn/git/trees/bf1002b43ae1e73c8cd34ddb482aaa303d936a70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-vpn/git/commits/5587d9fd6953469fb3c849d83edde30ad4f63cf7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-beneti