/api.github.com/users/sudeep31/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudeep31/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudeep31/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudeep31/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudeep31","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudeep31/angularTodo/commits/2052a7da1f0792c55d577253562826c8e0d94baf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T06:46:57Z","email":"sudeep.parchure@gmail.com","name":"sudeep31"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T06:46:57Z","email":"sudeep.parchure@gmail.com","name":"sudeep31"},"message":"feat(guide): Add Section 3.11 - Angular 21.x Exclusive APIs\n\n- 3.11.1: resource() and httpResource() - declarative reactive HTTP\n- 3.11.2: Signal-based queries - viewChild/contentChild/viewChildren/contentChildren\n- 3.11.3: @let template variable declarations (Angular 18+/21.1)\n- 3.11.4: afterRender() / afterNextRender() - SSR-safe browser lifecycle hooks\n- 3.11.5: untracked() - break signal dependency chains in effects\n- 3.11.6: DestroyRef - explicit cleanup for non-RxJS resources\n- 3.11.7: Input transforms - booleanAttribute / numberAttribute\n- 3.11.8: outputFromObservable() / outputToObservable() RxJS bridge\n- 3.11.9: withEventReplay() - SSR event capture before hydration\n- 3.11.10: Route-level SSR RenderMode - Prerender/Server/Client per route\n- 3.11.11: provideZonelessChangeDetection() stable API (was experimental)\n- 3.11.12: provideAppInitializer() - Angular 19+ bootstrap pattern\n\nFix: provideExperimentalZonelessChangeDetection -> provideZonelessChangeDetection\nFix: @ViewChild decorators -> viewChild.required() signal queries\nDocument grows from 11,648 to 12,558 lines","tree":{"sha":"c1baca91bd2f1b35095c20fb8d62648861c90bc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudeep31/angularTodo/git/trees/c1baca91bd2f1b35095c20fb8d62648861c90bc3"},"url