:{"date":"2026-04-13T08:10:28Z","email":"sudeep.parchure@gmail.com","name":"sudeep31"},"message":"chore(copilot): slim copilot-instructions, distribute rules to scoped files, add boundaries\n\n- Trim copilot-instructions.md to lean global file (token budgeting)\n- Move non-negotiables, folder structure, error prevention to angular.instructions.md\n- Add strict CSS boundaries section to tailwind.instructions.md\n- Add error prevention and test coverage rules to testing.instructions.md\n- Expand Boundaries: add no-hallucinations, no-assumptions, no-unsolicited-improvements, ask-first\n- Remove Testing Patterns code block from angular.instructions.md (belongs in testing.instructions.md)\n- Replace large component/service code examples with MCP server callouts\n- Remove duplicate Angular Best Practices Enforcement block","tree":{"sha":"8232f104c886da16d01667ad590224634b81d086","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudeep31/angularTodo/git/trees/8232f104c886da16d01667ad590224634b81d086"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudeep31/angularTodo/git/commits/1358f9d044de1e2ddd6e9fa81e6669aed2498a59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10875240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudeep31/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudeep31/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudeep31/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudeep31/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sudeep31","id":10875240,"login":"sudeep31","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODc1MjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudeep31/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudeep31/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudeep31/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudeep31/starred{/owner}{/repo}","s