09Z","email":"sudeep.parchure@gmail.com","name":"sudeep31"},"message":"feat: wire Angular Todo app to json-server API with full UI overhaul\n\n- Add Angular environment files (dev/prod) with apiBaseUrl config\n- Add fileReplacements in angular.json for production environment swap\n- Implement TodoApiService with signal-based state and HTTP CRUD operations\n- Consume TodoApiService in TodoListComponent (replaces local signals)\n- Integrate TodoItemComponent with priority badges, due date, tags, edit/delete\n- Remove all debug styling (red body bg, bright borders, !important rules)\n- Apply Inter font via Google Fonts and light slate-50 theme globally\n- Clean app.html to minimal nav + main + footer layout (no debug markup)\n- Add json-server db.json and npm script for mock REST API on port 3000\n- Configure TailwindCSS with postcss.config.js and tailwind.config.js\n\nGitHub Copilot infrastructure:\n- Add Code & PR Reviewer agent (.github/agents/code-reviewer.agent.md)\n  with 7 checklists: Angular 21, ES6+/TypeScript, Security (OWASP),\n  Accessibility (WCAG AA), Performance (NgOptimizedImage/@defer/CDK),\n  Common Developer Mistakes (loop/if-else/signal anti-patterns),\n  Test Coverage\n- MCP angular-cli_get_best_practices added as step 1 of review workflow\n- ES6+ section expanded: destructuring, spread/rest, structuredClone\n- Expand Copilot instructions and TailwindCSS instruction file\n- Add LinkedIn article on Copilot setup for Angular (documents/)","tree":{"sha":"4eb602c2fbd3c9264d1d36170320a7a042768073","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudeep31/angularTodo/git/trees/4eb602c2fbd3c9264d1d36170320a7a042768073"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sudeep31/angularTodo/git/commits/63d4e5da277e4ed42b6f0b49178538b84e8ea254","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10875240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sudeep31/even