on: required fields, min 6 char password\n- Styled with theme CSS variables\n- Export via Module Federation ./components\n- Wire into shell-template Login page via lazy loading\n- 8 co-located unit tests for LoginForm, 100% coverage\n- Update shell-template Login tests and mocks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address CodeRabbit findings on LoginForm PR\n\n- Add aria-invalid and aria-describedby for accessibility\n- Import LoginForm.css in component, add CSS mock for Jest\n- Use CSS variable for focus ring color instead of hardcoded value\n- Add error handling for lazy-loaded remote module failure\n- Fix mock to pass through actual typed input values\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: add defensive check for LoginForm export in lazy import\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: replace catch fallback with error boundary for lazy imports\n\nReact.lazy caches the first resolved value permanently, so a .catch()\nfallback would be stuck for the session. Use an ErrorBoundary with\nretry instead so transient remote failures can be recovered.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c19a19d4d9bf6c424a5f5bbce4a24b4a2ce8973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leandrorojas/hoi-poi/git/trees/2c19a19d4d9bf6c424a5f5bbce4a24b4a2ce8973"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leandrorojas/hoi-poi/git/commits/bd13202e17b82877eedfd7bc97a0f68faee8e9b8","verification":{"payload":"tree 2c19a19d4d9bf6c424a5f5bbce4a24b4a2ce8973\nparent 72ae2e0873f1173309e829e75752da06de367a58\nauthor leandrorojas <leandrorojas@gmail.com> 1775874868 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775874868 -0300\n\nBuild login UI component with form validation (#16)\n\n* feat: build login UI component with form validation\n\n- Add LoginForm component with username/password fields and submit button\n- Basic validation: required fields, min 6 char password\n- Styled with theme CSS variables\n- Export via Module Federation ./components\n- Wire into shell-template Login page via lazy loading\n- 8 co-located unit tests for LoginForm, 100% coverage\n- Update shell-template Login tests and mocks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address CodeRabbit findings on LoginForm PR\n\n- Add aria-invalid and aria-describedby for accessibility\n- Import LoginForm.css in component, add CSS mock for Jest\n- Use CSS variable for focus ring color instead of hardcoded value\n- Add error handling for lazy-loaded remote module failure\n- Fix mock to pass through actual typed input values\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: add defensive check for LoginForm export in lazy import\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: replace catch fallback with error boundary for lazy imports\n\nReact.lazy caches the first resolved value permanently, so a .catch()\nfallback would be stuck for the session. Use an ErrorBoundary with\nretry instead so transient remote failures can be recovered.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2bM0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwfQQABSDhSXhLw/KVExW/9Sm3BEK\nprLHIYjYlMiyx3WffK7R1OCPuj/Ze1FBF467E5mw0gq66lEBTF5Eyo+WuLneW/X1\noAQvAS+3Rm/8K6GbQWczHD5W4N4akCp9L7YjKkJ+rXQX/XLAFKeGMpFlmqPplawv\nfKkwUmFFs0rMfQ4SBYX1uCXrkTavrrWz73PWDoQaz6F0mu0+GhLqo3KbGPzcXKWg\nP7Sr3KPJUChKM0vaPVu+Hgbh1vR4Pu/8p7RYOQPZsylbfMtzwvus8PnPlvARZ1o4\nm7pHW2T+SLJ+ptnHnLHReJ3zkCNIntP9k4hkh3WsgATOakiho0N+LHxcxCDpQeVJ\nd8olypkRoWUy9/jfji7644+tgeXvqRA2a7IhOnB68M6jOszZ1y1DW6RxPSNIdfuQ\n5JksNG6tZ0RE72G4Hq1XzHRCWJNbWxCTHnGIlKfMyJLm4+VvFV