e":"leandrorojas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T20:13:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Scaffold basic routing with route guards (#11)\n\n* feat: scaffold basic routing with route guards\n\n- Add react-router-dom to shell-template with Module Federation shared config\n- Create placeholder Login page with sign-in flow\n- Create placeholder BackOffice page with sign-out flow\n- Add ProtectedRoute guard that redirects to /login without auth token\n- Default route redirects to /login, /backoffice is protected\n- Co-located unit tests for all pages and route guard (9 tests)\n- Add TextEncoder polyfill for jsdom + react-router compatibility\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: exclude shell-template from root Jest test runner\n\nRoot Jest was picking up shell-template tests in CI, causing\nfailures due to missing react-router-dom dependency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address CodeRabbit findings on routing PR\n\n- Extract AUTH_TOKEN_KEY to shared constant (auth/constants.js)\n- Test real App component instead of duplicating routes in test\n- Add backend auth comment to ProtectedRoute\n- Pin react-router-dom requiredVersion in Module Federation config\n- Add test script to shell-template package.json\n- Exclude shell-template from root Jest runner\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4917dc69e4bc9044799a91d874b6d6476d58da57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leandrorojas/hoi-poi/git/trees/4917dc69e4bc9044799a91d874b6d6476d58da57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leandrorojas/hoi-poi/git/commits/3307f27757516708fb2398bee607170c677f9694","verification":{"payload":"tree 4917dc69e4bc9044799a91d874b6d6476d58da57\nparent 96137f00997a8aa82edb4feb6da491590fbab940\nauthor leandrorojas <leandrorojas@gmail.com> 1775852014 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775852014 -0300\n\nScaffold basic routing with route guards (#11)\n\n* feat: scaffold basic routing with route guards\n\n- Add react-router-dom to shell-template with Module Federation shared config\n- Create placeholder Login page with sign-in flow\n- Create placeholder BackOffice page with sign-out flow\n- Add ProtectedRoute guard that redirects to /login without auth token\n- Default route redirects to /login, /backoffice is protected\n- Co-located unit tests for all pages and route guard (9 tests)\n- Add TextEncoder polyfill for jsdom + react-router compatibility\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: exclude shell-template from root Jest test runner\n\nRoot Jest was picking up shell-template tests in CI, causing\nfailures due to missing react-router-dom dependency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address CodeRabbit findings on routing PR\n\n- Extract AUTH_TOKEN_KEY to shared constant (auth/constants.js)\n- Test real App component instead of duplicating routes in test\n- Add backend auth comment to ProtectedRoute\n- Pin react-router-dom requiredVersion in Module Federation config\n- Add test script to shell-template package.json\n- Exclude shell-template from root Jest runner\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2VnuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9HAQAIHHJqN0qez3/Msp61hHIWAN\nrXfyLC8m3Rp7h1LpV2NJnRBmuufRx2sWociOKmprqQrOCCZ6EudEQFDNQ7MAECrj\nEZLWaPWr2zC6N/HF6mzJbo8CZaTfLRf2RW93MSKkhq80S580phzF3lOtBMQvbSgC\nlD9aBFSn+ZH3Qi7+v1ApRFhL2pw2JxB6lta3C8PYZ7uD8AkCiwwLdcKtlSAvHXJC\naANhkN3PTnJ5ECnz8Q5zxkVhYKYIlCQPq6Qe/Mk2zLwzccmd+Ds1jn33wWd3AT+j\nAH7UGY2XFmViooJuLJiqGZye7GyScmRHHwR/+jDCM+u1U+g1rZSOdHarh5XmZBT9\n5HNk5aozm9A4PVTsQHZm