 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775847962 -0300\n\nCreate base React app with Webpack in shell-template (#8)\n\n* feat: create base React app with Webpack in shell-template\n\n- React 19 + Webpack 5 + Module Federation host config\n- Async bootstrap entry point for Module Federation compatibility\n- Babel with automatic JSX runtime\n- Dev server on port 3000 with history API fallback\n- Build verified successfully\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: address CodeRabbit findings on shell-template PR\n\n- Add co-located App.test.jsx with Jest + React Testing Library\n- Use exact versions (no caret) in Module Federation shared config\n- Fix applies to both shell-template and root webpack configs\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: pin exact React versions to match Module Federation config\n\nCaret ranges could resolve to newer versions than what Module\nFederation expects, risking runtime version negotiation issues.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2UoaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKHUQAJd4oSh8YWfs3xdRrb8iZ49K\n1LFBT/r35w+PEPKBKkcZCFiIiSHOH3NyCl7HTAJS0MC080erkzZatNN9Ij3vuUt1\nGJcjR+dW5V8P8AMcpQPJAzWrGeufmEh0oYxL2tpCuEvotETAi7h4oxskGaVHytCH\nGCQeLi0ZKBeEKGjHdPPc0rm/Mqonw3ZxjSTXMfy2OyJy0SKZN6UfhDyOE29qcHgI\nZhKlvk43S8W9Nx4T3nwYuoNW3o7XhLMzH6VNdyfyzKwttwNdw0ScPLfPkZTseA1/\n16tDws2N7o7TRDrop2CMWOMBOeD2MbVxjifLE+WfrmF4Ty1puaCPUaoGUzNkQuA5\nwQ8/1qy5nDxKQ4+D4uMO2MQmu9mS66uHXNGYHQ9xrFB+CN8lFkQ95iXa0xajJBSh\nyYD5QReu1N9oAPU5LQqZZgP/RkcH2HbYLazSz3JSg+t3IBxxGcPfEs1rk9z57wFF\nh4M9dFUuLF1aXhQA1MUUkDxUkPe9yuaqDH9yAT+LdHPu1MuNmkkOx68HMA0AcGkg\nyq0lVwVjhUCn8LT1auKC0sr3JmxaaSqPN8mt1q7IQXgQZWA7zgjKrKPUhEKUfvne\nZHMAZRsERyaSP0OMKKE//X6fXE1cOGiibLg8Nz3I90XWUbroag1TOKVT1E5IwW0D\nNHzosjxKrVaUJxxvQKpO