d testing, linting, and address CodeRabbit findings\n\n- Add Jest + React Testing Library with 100% coverage\n- Add ESLint 9 with React and hooks plugins\n- Add co-located App.test.jsx\n- Extract Babel config to babel.config.js (shared by Webpack and Jest)\n- Fix dev script to include --mode development\n- Guard against null root element in bootstrap.js\n- Pin React version in Module Federation shared config\n- Remove eager loading from shared dependencies\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: upload test coverage to SonarCloud\n\n- Run tests with coverage in CI before SonarQube scan\n- Configure sonar-project.properties with LCOV report path\n- Add coverage exclusions matching Jest config\n- Add coverage/ to .gitignore\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9cd8cb21cf6ae29448335cc2148074079c549ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leandrorojas/hoi-poi/git/trees/d9cd8cb21cf6ae29448335cc2148074079c549ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leandrorojas/hoi-poi/git/commits/0f8813855b8b624511f1a4dcd710952d1d337f5b","verification":{"payload":"tree d9cd8cb21cf6ae29448335cc2148074079c549ef\nparent b9a509dc8a5a0b9da8f0b24c267b92fdff801c78\nauthor leandrorojas <leandrorojas@gmail.com> 1775832553 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775832553 -0300\n\nSet up base tech stack (React + Webpack + Module Federation) (#5)\n\n* chore: set up base tech stack (React + Webpack + Module Federation)\n\n- React 19 + ReactDOM\n- Webpack 5 with Module Federation plugin\n- Babel with env and react presets\n- Async bootstrap entry point for Module Federation\n- Minimal App shell and placeholder component/util exports\n- Dev server on port 3000\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: add testing, linting, and address CodeRabbit findings\n\n- Add Jest + React Tes