:"https://api.github.com/repos/rechedev9/react-goodways/commits/eed55edae57f0c7383a984f061213644d35fe03c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T18:14:18Z","email":"rsnoverwatch@gmail.com","name":"rechedev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T18:14:18Z","email":"rsnoverwatch@gmail.com","name":"rechedev"},"message":"chore: initial commit — isvidal react stack dashboard\n\nStandalone Streamlit app extracted from the parent scrapper monorepo.\nAnalyzes 199 MediaVida forum posts (2020-2026) from user isvidal to\ndetermine his current React/TypeScript tool recommendations.\n\nContents:\n- app.py: dashboard (recomienda / desaconseja / mixto verdicts, stance-\n  colored excerpts, evolution heatmap, dense posts)\n- analyze_isvidal.py: analysis pipeline (term matching, stance merge,\n  recency-weighted verdict computation)\n- 6 parquets with precomputed data (posts, term matrix, excerpts, code\n  features, top posts, stack summary)\n- stance_cache.json: 200+ excerpt stance classifications\n- analysis_report.md: human-readable summary\n- README.md: methodology, current stack summary, limitations, license\n- requirements.txt: streamlit, plotly, polars, pandas\n- .gitignore: standard Python + Streamlit secrets\n\nReady for Streamlit Cloud deployment. Entry point: app.py.","tree":{"sha":"dcbebd948275be96e6599e71003b8a1028e3df0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rechedev9/react-goodways/git/trees/dcbebd948275be96e6599e71003b8a1028e3df0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rechedev9/react-goodways/git/commits/eed55edae57f0c7383a984f061213644d35fe03c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/137654521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rechedev9/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rechedev9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rechedev9/following{/other_user}","gi