,"email":"abbasvavanna@gmail.com","name":"Ahmed Abbas"},"message":"Fix CI: install allure-pytest in both AI planner workflows\n\npytest.ini applies --alluredir/--clean-alluredir repo-wide via addopts,\nso any pytest invocation in this repo requires allure-pytest installed\nor it fails at argument-parsing time before any test even runs. This\naffected both AI Planner Smoke Tests and Failure Classifier Smoke Tests\n-- the latter''s first run failed on exactly this. Confirmed the fix\nlocally by reproducing the CI environment (only anthropic/pytest/\nplaywright installed, real pytest.ini present) before and after adding\nallure-pytest.","tree":{"sha":"22668458c9982ebdf701ecc03a970b1417a40552","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aabbasahd92/openmrs-qa/git/trees/22668458c9982ebdf701ecc03a970b1417a40552"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aabbasahd92/openmrs-qa/git/commits/e8c036db2fda9f7d163e7928224d3b5f9a8f903f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35062247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahamedabbas92","id":35062247,"login":"ahamedabbas92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MDYyMjQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamed