bbas"},"message":"Document failure classifier: real bug caught, live run results, and an honest limitation\n\nIncludes the outcome=''error'' vs ''failed'' bug found during its own first run,\nthe 25/25 ENVIRONMENT_ISSUE classification result with zero false positives,\nand an honest note that 15 of 25 rationales were repetitive restatements of\nthe same root cause -- a real limitation, not hidden to make the tool look\nbetter than it is.","tree":{"sha":"5de1def36a95bc40aeef4f1166938296c2917a46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aabbasahd92/openmrs-qa/git/trees/5de1def36a95bc40aeef4f1166938296c2917a46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aabbasahd92/openmrs-qa/git/commits/96b9928be4998cda0919d246343fcf285c57c2ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35062247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahamedabbas92","id":35062247,"login":"ahamedabbas92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MDYyMjQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aabbasahd92/openmrs-qa/commit/96b9928be4998cda0919d246343fcf285c57c2ae","node_id":"C_kwDOR-YcYtoAKDk2Yjk5MjhiZTQ5OThjZGEwOTE5ZDI0NjM0M2ZjZjI4NWM1N2MyYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aabbasahd92/openmrs-qa/commit/f57b6170d9c9159c1867743047aa0d26411571d5","sha":"f57b6170d9c9159c1867743047aa0d26411571d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aabbasahd92/openmrs-qa/commits/f57b6170d9c9159c1867743047aa0d26411571d5"}],"sha":"96b9928be4998cda0919d246343fcf285c57c2ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aabbasahd92/openmrs-qa/commits/96b9928be4998cda0919d246343fcf285c57c2ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35062247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahamedabbas92","id":35062247,"login":"ahamedabbas92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MDYyMjQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aabbasahd92/openmrs-qa/commits/f57b6170d9c9159c1867743047aa0d26411571d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T00:15:17Z","email":"abbasvavanna@gmail.com","name":"Ahmed Abbas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T00:15:17Z","email":"abbasvavanna@gmail.com","name":"Ahmed Abbas"},"message":"Add self-diagnosing test failure classifier (human review required, no auto-fix)\n\nai_planner/failure_classifier.py: takes a pytest-json-report output, sends\neach failed/errored test''s traceback to Claude, and classifies root cause as\nLOCATOR_DRIFT, TIMING_ISSUE, ENVIRONMENT_ISSUE, REAL_DEFECT, or UNKNOWN, with\na suggested minimal fix. Never modifies test code, retries tests, or opens\nPRs -- output is a Markdown report for human review only.\n\n8/8 unit tests passing (mocked), including a regression test for a real bug\nfound during first live run: pytest-json-report uses outcome=''error'' for\nfixture setup failures, distinct from outcome=''failed'' -- the initial version\nonly checked for ''failed'' and would have silently dropped 15 of 25 real\nfailures from classification.\n\nLive run against pytest_report.json (25 real failures from the ongoing\ntest3.openmrs.org outage) correctly classified all 25 as ENVIRONMENT_ISSUE\nwith zero false positives into LOCATOR_DRIFT or TIMING_ISSUE. Report\ndocumented in specs/healing_reports/run-2026-07-11.md, including one notably\ngood suggested fix: check page.goto() response status before waiting on a\nlocator, to fail fast with a clear signal instead of a 20s timeout.","tree":{"sha":"3710dba38528db25d51d94626e56f6c8617d78ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aabbasahd92/openmrs-qa/git/trees/3710dba38528db25d51d94626e56f6c8617d78ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aabbasahd92/openmrs-qa/git/commits/f57b6170d9c9159c1867743047aa0d26411571d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35062247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahamedabbas92","id":35062247,"login":"ahamedabbas92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MDYyMjQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.githu