4bc57c81c1622d914b39cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T19:52:18Z","email":"abbasvavanna@gmail.com","name":"Ahmed Abbas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T19:52:18Z","email":"abbasvavanna@gmail.com","name":"Ahmed Abbas"},"message":"Fix capture_dom_evidence: replace deprecated Page.accessibility.snapshot() with Locator.aria_snapshot()\n\nPage.accessibility was removed in current Playwright releases, causing\nAttributeError on any live run. Rewrote to use the supported aria_snapshot()\nAPI. Also made navigation failures non-fatal — an unreachable page (timeout,\nDNS failure, bot-challenge block) is itself valid evidence for the planner\nto reason over, rather than crashing the run. This is the exact fix that\nenabled the live guardrail-case run documented in AI_PLANNER_README.md.","tree":{"sha":"eed06b838ad89055b7ff525fa1832c153d8e6ccb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aabbasahd92/openmrs-qa/git/trees/eed06b838ad89055b7ff525fa1832c153d8e6ccb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aabbasahd92/openmrs-qa/git/commits/5247ab21c34ae2be104bc57c81c1622d914b39cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35062247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahamedabbas92","id":35062247,"login":"ahamedabbas92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MDYyMjQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahamedabbas92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.co