s a base palette with theme-aware overrides for text, lightText,\ninactiveBg, activeBg, and cellBorder. Brand colours stay unchanged — they\nread fine on both themes.\n\nEach viz file:\n  - Module-level `const colors = {…}` renamed to `baseColors`.\n  - Component pulls themed palette via `const colors = useVizColors(baseColors)`.\n  - JSX still references `colors.X`; only the binding source changes.","tree":{"sha":"134f3a0daaf2380a7eafc2d8e3b914a58e6c4059","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boymep/kickassjs/git/trees/134f3a0daaf2380a7eafc2d8e3b914a58e6c4059"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boymep/kickassjs/git/commits/aec165bb0c2122a3cec4759898cafa2fc50ea1fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59249965?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boymep","id":59249965,"login":"boymep","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MjQ5OTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/boymep/kickassjs/commit/aec165bb0c2122a3cec4759898cafa2fc50ea1fc","node_id":"C_kwDOR-YuitoAKGFlYzE2NWJiMGMyMTIyYTNjZWM0NzU5ODk4Y2FmYTJmYzUwZWExZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/boymep/kickassjs/commit/77618c294b550ee30d1d13b3435e45b87d8412dd","sha":"77618c294b550ee30d1d13b3435e45b87d8412dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boymep/kickassjs/commits/77618c294b550ee30d1d13b3435e45b87d8412dd"}],"sha":"aec165bb0c2122a3cec4759898cafa2fc50ea1fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boymep/kickassjs/commits/aec165bb0c2122a3cec4759898cafa2fc50ea1fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59249965?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/boymep","id":59249965,"login":"boymep","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MjQ5OTY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boymep","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boymep/kickassjs/commits/77618c294b550ee30d1d13b3435e45b87d8412dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:24:38Z","email":"dan1lpanov@mail.ru","name":"Boymep"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T21:24:38Z","email":"dan1lpanov@mail.ru","name":"Boymep"},"message":"feat: rebuild app as universal interview-prep textbook\n\nReplace the four-tab layout (theory/quiz/practice/flashcards) with a\nsingle progressive Lesson page per topic. Practice stays separate but\nnow supports four problem formats. Add a System Design section.\n\nMajor changes:\n\n- New Lesson type and unified content per topic: chapters with theory\n  blocks, in-chapter checkpoints, inline playgrounds, curated YouTube\n  videos and external links, final quiz, flashcard deck, cheatsheet,\n  and a dedicated InterviewQA section.\n- 25 authored lessons total: 6 algorithms, 8 JavaScript, 4 Node.js, 7\n  System Design (rendering, caching, auth, performance, api-design,\n  scaling, observability).\n- Practice problems extended via discriminated union: implement,\n  predict-output, find-bug (incl. perf gate), refactor. ~140 problems\n  across 18 code topics, audited at runtime end-to-end via\n  scripts/audit-problems.mjs (128/128 checks pass).\n- Bug-hunt page rewritten as a linear runner ordered by difficulty\n  with code editor + test runner per item; all 20 items now have full\n  test scaffolding.\n- Cheatsheet page becomes an aggregator: per-topic outlines plus the\n  universal interview-solving guide as tabs.\n- Sticky table of contents with scroll-spy on lessons; uniform video\n  card sizing (360 fixed, 16:9 aspect); equal-height topic and tool\n  cards on home page.\n- Router redirects legacy /theory, /quiz, /flashcards URLs to the new\n  /topic/:slug with the relevant hash anchors. TopicNav shows two tabs\n  (Theory / Practice) and hides Practice when the topic has no\n  problems (System Design).\n\nRemoved legacy paths and data files: data/theory/* (18 files),\nTheoryPage, QuizPage, FlashcardsPage, synthesizeLesson — all\nunreferenced after the migration.\n\nTooling:\n\n- scripts/audit-problems.mjs validates that solutionCode passes every\n  testCase, buggyCode fails at least one, and refactor''s perf gate\n  fires (skips DOM/class-functionName problems).\n- New vitest suite asserts lesson invariants: YouTube id format,\n  https-only links, unique chapter ids, no checkpoint/finalQuiz id\n  overlap, intro length floor.\n- .claude/settings.json consolidates ~70 specific permissions into\n  ~30 wildcards (curl, npm, node, pkill, etc.).","tree":{"sha":"f01caa35603a6a5469e176573d48661ba217bd69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/boymep/kickassjs/git/trees/f01caa35603a6a5469e176573d48661ba217bd69"},"url":"