y checks\n2. Type Check - TypeScript compiler validation\n3. Unit Tests - Jasmine/Karma tests with coverage\n4. E2E Tests - Playwright end-to-end tests\n5. Build - Production bundle with size checks\n6. Deploy - Production deployment (main branch only)\n7. Accessibility - AXE compliance audits\n8. Performance - Lighthouse CI performance scores\n\nFEATURES:\n- Runs on all push/PR to main/develop branches\n- Parallel job execution for faster feedback\n- Coverage reports uploaded to Codecov\n- Test artifacts uploaded (reports, screenshots)\n- Bundle size validation (max 1MB)\n- Deploy only on main branch pushes\n- Performance and accessibility audits\n\nTRIGGERS:\n- Push to main/develop branches\n- Pull requests to main/develop branches\n\nThis pipeline ensures code quality, test coverage, and production readiness.","tree":{"sha":"fa05e9ba50c96da71fcf212efc41b1f4d156a1a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/trees/fa05e9ba50c96da71fcf212efc41b1f4d156a1a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/commits/d005bb8636ff10a89779f28a27757167ef11fb01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64451578?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjAldrinho/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjAldrinho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjAldrinho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjAldrinho/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho","id":64451578,"login":"DjAldrinho","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NDUxNTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjAldrinho/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjAldrinho/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjAldrinho/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users