d7c4c8d6d4221de103e17a9ca21b5bad388a8dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T23:40:07Z","email":"aldray.devsoft@gmail.com","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T23:40:07Z","email":"aldray.devsoft@gmail.com","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"message":"test: add Jest testing infrastructure and base service tests\n\n**Jest Configuration:**\n- jest.config.js: Complete Jest configuration for Angular\n- testEnvironment: jsdom for browser-like testing\n- Coverage threshold: 70% for all metrics\n- Module aliases for clean imports\n\n**Test Setup:**\n- src/setup-jest.ts: Global test setup with mocks\n- Mocks for: window.matchMedia, IntersectionObserver, ResizeObserver, localStorage, sessionStorage\n- @testing-library/jest-dom for DOM assertions\n\n**Base Service Tests:**\n- Complete unit tests for BaseService\n- HTTP method tests (GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE)\n- Error handling tests (404, 500, network errors)\n- URL building tests (path params, query params)\n\n**Scripts Added:**\n- test:watch: Run tests in watch mode\n- test:coverage: Run tests with coverage report\n- test:unit: Run specific test file\n- e2e: Run Playwright E2E tests\n- e2e:ui: Run E2E with UI\n- e2e:debug: Run E2E in debug mode\n\n**Angular Configuration:**\n- Updated test builder to @angular-builders:jest\n- Configured tsConfig.spec.json\n- Added zone.js polyfills for testing\n\n**Status:** Testing infrastructure ready. Requires esbuild config fix for full integration.\nCan be completed in Phase 11 as dedicated testing phase.","tree":{"sha":"f093851bd158c14c75db9c0d55708ce4f28d758f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/trees/f093851bd158c14c75db9c0d55708ce4f28d758f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/commits/2d7c4c8d6d4221de103e17a9ca21b5bad388a8dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://ava