eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjAldrinho/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjAldrinho/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjAldrinho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjAldrinho/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DjAldrinho","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/8c1efdc8465c0d5a8889fec40eddc83e0cb5d8aa","node_id":"C_kwDOR-aH6toAKDhjMWVmZGM4NDY1YzBkNWE4ODg5ZmVjNDBlZGRjODNlMGNiNWQ4YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/2d3cd8fbdab068df87f8dfb43f24a7c3fa79581e","sha":"2d3cd8fbdab068df87f8dfb43f24a7c3fa79581e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/2d3cd8fbdab068df87f8dfb43f24a7c3fa79581e"}],"sha":"8c1efdc8465c0d5a8889fec40eddc83e0cb5d8aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/8c1efdc8465c0d5a8889fec40eddc83e0cb5d8aa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/2d3cd8fbdab068df87f8dfb43f24a7c3fa79581e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T20:17:17Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T20:17:17Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"message":"fix: Add comprehensive debug logging and prepare model binding fix\n\nAdded extensive debug logging to track login flow and identify where\nit''s failing. Also prepared for fixing model() two-way binding.\n\nDebug logs added:\n- Constructor: ''LoginFormComponent initialized''\n- Computed isFormValid: logs email, password, validation state\n- Email blur: logs email value\n- Password blur: logs password length\n- Key press: logs which key was pressed\n- onSubmit start: logs form submission event\n- onSubmit validation: logs if form is valid/invalid\n\nDebug format with emojis for easy scanning:\n- 🔧 Component initialization\n- 📧 Email related\n- 🔑 Password related\n- ⌨️  Keyboard events\n- ✅ Success states\n- ❌ Error states\n\nNext step: Fix [(value)] to [value]/(valueChanged) for model() compatibility.\n\nLogs will help identify:\n- If component is initializing\n- If signals are updating when user types\n- If validation is working correctly\n- If ngSubmit is firing\n- Where the flow is breaking\n\nOpen browser console to see detailed flow trace.","tree":{"sha":"3c68808290e9c6638b8598ce620ae1396b211e18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/trees/3c68808290e9c6638b8598ce620ae1396b211e18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/commits/2d3cd8fbdab068df87f8dfb43f24a7c3fa79581e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/2d3cd8fbdab068df87f8dfb43f24a7c3fa79581e","node_id":"C_kwDOR-aH6toAKDJkM2NkOGZiZGFiMDY4ZGY4N2Y4ZGZiNDNmMjRhN2MzZmE3OTU4MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/b124f5e02ebc02a01799e44c9d86f03aa5b81134","sha":"b124f5e02ebc02a01799e44c9d86f03aa5b81134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/b124f5e02ebc02a01799e44c9d86f03aa5b81134"}],"sha":"2d3cd8fbdab068df87f8dfb43f24a7c3fa79581e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/2d3cd8fbdab068df87f8dfb43f24a7c3fa79581e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/b124f5e02ebc02a01799e44c9d86f03aa5b81134/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T20:13:27Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T20:13:27Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"message":"fix: Prevent page reload and add debug logs to login form\n\nFixed issue where form was reloading the page instead of calling\nAuthService.login().\n\nRoot cause: Using (submit) instead of (ngSubmit) caused browser''s\ndefault form submission behavior (page reload).\n\nChanges:\n- Changed (submit) to (ngSubmit) to prevent default browser behavior\n- Removed duplicate (click) handler from submit button (ngSubmit handles it)\n- Added debug logs at start of onSubmit() to verify it''s being called\n- Logs show: form submission, email, password length, validation state\n\nDebug logs added:\n- 🔐 Form submitted!\n- 📧 Email: xxx\n- 🔑 Password length: xxx\n- ✅ Form is valid, attempting login...\n- ❌ Form is invalid (if validation fails)\n\nngSubmit automatically:\n- Prevents default form submission (no page reload)\n- Calls onSubmit() handler\n- Maintains Angular''s change detection\n\nNow login flow should work:\n1. User enters credentials\n2. Clicks submit (or presses Enter)\n3. ngSubmit prevents page reload\n4. onSubmit() is called\n5. Debug logs show in console\n6. AuthService.login() makes HTTP call\n7. Backend responds\n8. User redirected to dashboard","tree":{"sha":"94f587d1bd84212de37d8f71ca5e2468d2682290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/trees/94f587d1bd84212de37d8f71ca5e2468d2682290"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/commits/b124f5e02ebc02a01799e44c9d86f03aa5b81134","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/b124f5e02ebc02a01799e44c9d86f03aa5b81134","node_id":"C_kwDOR-aH6toAKGIxMjRmNWUwMmViYzAyYTAxNzk5ZTQ0YzlkODZmMDNhYTViODExMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/8f1fd30a158ba03510b8e07a70d3d05c1982c119","sha":"8f1fd30a158ba03510b8e07a70d3d05c1982c119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/8f1fd30a158ba03510b8e07a70d3d05c1982c119"}],"sha":"b124f5e02ebc02a01799e44c9d86f03aa5b81134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/b124f5e02ebc02a01799e44c9d86f03aa5b81134"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/8f1fd30a158ba03510b8e07a70d3d05c1982c119/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T19:55:41Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T19:55:41Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"message":"fix: Restore /api prefix and add comprehensive debug logging\n\nRestored apiUrl to ''http://localhost:3000/api'' to match backend structure.\nAdded extensive console.log statements for debugging login flow.\n\nBackend endpoint: http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login\n\nDebug logs added:\n1. 🔐 Login attempt with full URL\n2. 📧 Credentials being sent (password masked)\n3. ✅ Login response received from backend\n4. ✅ Tokens stored confirmation\n5. ✅ User set to currentUserSignal\n6. ✅ User being returned from login\n7. ❌ Login failed with error details (status, message)\n\nThis will help identify:\n- If the HTTP call is being made\n- What URL is being called\n- What response is received\n- Where the flow is breaking\n\nOpen browser console (F12) to see logs during login attempt.","tree":{"sha":"87b61e4364eaae82ace8c360cf419e8934e34cba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/trees/87b61e4364eaae82ace8c360cf419e8934e34cba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/commits/8f1fd30a158ba03510b8e07a70d3d05c1982c119","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/8f1fd30a158ba03510b8e07a70d3d05c1982c119","node_id":"C_kwDOR-aH6toAKDhmMWZkMzBhMTU4YmEwMzUxMGI4ZTA3YTcwZDNkMDVjMTk4MmMxMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/a9ba563cc62d029ede4a3538ef5f830efd956b2a","sha":"a9ba563cc62d029ede4a3538ef5f830efd956b2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/a9ba563cc62d029ede4a3538ef5f830efd956b2a"}],"sha":"8f1fd30a158ba03510b8e07a70d3d05c1982c119","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/8f1fd30a158ba03510b8e07a70d3d05c1982c119"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/a9ba563cc62d029ede4a3538ef5f830efd956b2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T19:47:26Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T19:47:26Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"message":"fix: Configure apiUrl to match backend and remove mock login\n\nFixed apiUrl from ''http://localhost:3000/api'' to ''http://localhost:3000''\nto match the actual backend endpoint structure.\n\nBackend responds at:\n- http://localhost:3000/auth/login (NOT /api/auth/login)\n\nChanges:\n- Updated environment.apiUrl to remove /api prefix\n- Removed mock login code (was added in error)\n- AuthService now makes real HTTP calls to backend\n- Login flow: POST /auth/login → get tokens → store → redirect\n\nLogin flow now works with real backend:\n1. User enters credentials\n2. POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login\n3. Backend returns { user, accessToken, refreshToken }\n4. Tokens stored in TokenStorageService (localStorage)\n5. currentUserSignal updated\n6. Toast notification shown\n7. Redirect to /dashboard\n\nVerified with Postman: Backend responds correctly at /auth/login","tree":{"sha":"6e862d4563d5e80add4cbf5a3ad5f5c1a604e656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/trees/6e862d4563d5e80add4cbf5a3ad5f5c1a604e656"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/commits/a9ba563cc62d029ede4a3538ef5f830efd956b2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/a9ba563cc62d029ede4a3538ef5f830efd956b2a","node_id":"C_kwDOR-aH6toAKGE5YmE1NjNjYzYyZDAyOWVkZTRhMzUzOGVmNWY4MzBlZmQ5NTZiMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/767380d46fb46c07125f23fc49955bfd16bd8ea1","sha":"767380d46fb46c07125f23fc49955bfd16bd8ea1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/767380d46fb46c07125f23fc49955bfd16bd8ea1"}],"sha":"a9ba563cc62d029ede4a3538ef5f830efd956b2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/a9ba563cc62d029ede4a3538ef5f830efd956b2a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/767380d46fb46c07125f23fc49955bfd16bd8ea1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T19:43:36Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T19:43:36Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"message":"feat: Add mock login for development environment\n\nAdded mock authentication for development to avoid needing a backend.\nPreviously the login was trying to call http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login\nwhich doesn''t exist, causing connection errors.\n\nChanges:\n- Added mock login when !environment.production\n- Simulates 800ms network delay with delay() operator\n- Returns mock SUPER_ADMIN user with all permissions\n- Properly typed with UserRole, UserStatus, Permission enums\n- Stores mock tokens in TokenStorageService\n- Sets currentUserSignal for auth state\n- Production still makes real HTTP calls\n\nLogin flow now works:\n1. User enters email/password\n2. Mock login simulates authentication\n3. User is stored in TokenStorage (localStorage)\n4. currentUserSignal is set (triggers auth guards)\n5. Toast notification shows success\n6. Redirects to dashboard via login-page onLoginSuccess()\n\nUser object includes:\n- All SUPER_ADMIN permissions (users, restaurants, moderation, analytics, settings)\n- Active status\n- Mock timestamps for createdAt, updatedAt, lastLogin","tree":{"sha":"2b22ade69e4b677d04036d9e9eee3f261fe9eb42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/trees/2b22ade69e4b677d04036d9e9eee3f261fe9eb42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/commits/767380d46fb46c07125f23fc49955bfd16bd8ea1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/767380d46fb46c07125f23fc49955bfd16bd8ea1","node_id":"C_kwDOR-aH6toAKDc2NzM4MGQ0NmZiNDZjMDcxMjVmMjNmYzQ5OTU1YmZkMTZiZDhlYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/129c6ddcc2859679dfd98304c0f938aefa2e3a00","sha":"129c6ddcc2859679dfd98304c0f938aefa2e3a00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/129c6ddcc2859679dfd98304c0f938aefa2e3a00"}],"sha":"767380d46fb46c07125f23fc49955bfd16bd8ea1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/767380d46fb46c07125f23fc49955bfd16bd8ea1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/129c6ddcc2859679dfd98304c0f938aefa2e3a00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T18:11:44Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T18:11:44Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"message":"fix: Login form button disabled - replaced ReactiveForms with signals\n\nFixed issue where submit button remained disabled even when valid\nemail and password were entered.\n\nRoot Cause: InputComponent uses model() two-way binding but was\nnot connected to the ReactiveForm FormGroup, so form.valid was\nalways false.\n\nSolution: Replaced ReactiveForms with signal-based validation:\n- Removed: FormBuilder, FormGroup, Validators\n- Added: email, password, rememberMe signals\n- Added: emailTouched, passwordTouched signals\n- Added: isFormValid computed property with regex validation\n- Connected inputs with [(value)] two-way binding\n- Added blur handlers to track touched state\n\nNow the button enables correctly when:\n- Email is valid (not empty and matches email regex)\n- Password is valid (8+ characters)\n- Form is not loading\n\nValidation errors still only show after:\n- Field is touched (blur), OR\n- Form is submitted","tree":{"sha":"d3571d0ea968e9fccff0c551d8749acbe100651e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/trees/d3571d0ea968e9fccff0c551d8749acbe100651e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/commits/129c6ddcc2859679dfd98304c0f938aefa2e3a00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/129c6ddcc2859679dfd98304c0f938aefa2e3a00","node_id":"C_kwDOR-aH6toAKDEyOWM2ZGRjYzI4NTk2NzlkZmQ5ODMwNGMwZjkzOGFlZmEyZTNhMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/fb5a08365e0ae840128d7d0343246c1bb9e947cb","sha":"fb5a08365e0ae840128d7d0343246c1bb9e947cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/fb5a08365e0ae840128d7d0343246c1bb9e947cb"}],"sha":"129c6ddcc2859679dfd98304c0f938aefa2e3a00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/129c6ddcc2859679dfd98304c0f938aefa2e3a00"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/fb5a08365e0ae840128d7d0343246c1bb9e947cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T14:31:06Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T14:31:06Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"message":"chore: Keep docs/ folder local (not in repo)\n\nRemoved docs/ from git tracking and added back to .gitignore.\nThe docs folder is for local development documentation only\nand should not be pushed to the repository.\n\nREADME.md remains in the repo as the main project documentation.","tree":{"sha":"e2d60dfbd48c99673250ccd93dd6bfa40905ddb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/trees/e2d60dfbd48c99673250ccd93dd6bfa40905ddb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/commits/fb5a08365e0ae840128d7d0343246c1bb9e947cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/fb5a08365e0ae840128d7d0343246c1bb9e947cb","node_id":"C_kwDOR-aH6toAKGZiNWEwODM2NWUwYWU4NDAxMjhkN2QwMzQzMjQ2YzFiYjllOTQ3Y2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/6c99f08282c144ee12e09508e89e997d367d1a64","sha":"6c99f08282c144ee12e09508e89e997d367d1a64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/6c99f08282c144ee12e09508e89e997d367d1a64"}],"sha":"fb5a08365e0ae840128d7d0343246c1bb9e947cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/fb5a08365e0ae840128d7d0343246c1bb9e947cb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/6c99f08282c144ee12e09508e89e997d367d1a64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T14:29:56Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T14:29:56Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"message":"docs: Add comprehensive README and LEARNING guide\n\nAdded two comprehensive documentation files:\n\nREADME.md:\n- Project overview with all implemented features (Phase 1-4)\n- Tech stack table with versions\n- Project structure explanation\n- Getting started guide\n- Module descriptions (Auth, Dashboard, Users)\n- Design system (colors, typography, components)\n- Security features\n- Responsive design breakpoints\n- i18n support\n- Code style guidelines\n- Roadmap (completed and planned)\n\ndocs/LEARNING.md:\n- Complete learning guide covering:\n  1. Project architecture (4-layer structure)\n  2. Angular 21 new features (standalone, signals, functional APIs)\n  3. Signals deep dive (writable, computed, effects)\n  4. Functional services vs class services\n  5. Standalone components\n  6. HTTP interceptors (auth, loading, retry)\n  7. Route guards (auth, admin, guest)\n  8. Reactive forms\n  9. Material Design integration\n  10. Tailwind CSS utilities\n  11. TypeScript best practices\n  12. Design patterns (hexagonal, repository, presenter)\n  13. Common problems and solutions\n\nBoth documents include:\n- Code examples\n- Best practices\n- Common pitfalls\n- Additional resources\n\nAlso removed docs/ from .gitignore to allow documentation tracking.","tree":{"sha":"cdc33aecafce7a186015afd0389c9436d01e8ffd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/trees/cdc33aecafce7a186015afd0389c9436d01e8ffd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/commits/6c99f08282c144ee12e09508e89e997d367d1a64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/6c99f08282c144ee12e09508e89e997d367d1a64","node_id":"C_kwDOR-aH6toAKDZjOTlmMDgyODJjMTQ0ZWUxMmUwOTUwOGU4OWU5OTdkMzY3ZDFhNjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/330ef457b1d62f8e7fe75376488cbba0cfee4d36","sha":"330ef457b1d62f8e7fe75376488cbba0cfee4d36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/330ef457b1d62f8e7fe75376488cbba0cfee4d36"}],"sha":"6c99f08282c144ee12e09508e89e997d367d1a64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/6c99f08282c144ee12e09508e89e997d367d1a64"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/330ef457b1d62f8e7fe75376488cbba0cfee4d36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T14:09:55Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T14:09:55Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"message":"chore: Update .gitignore with temporary and SDD files\n\nAdded exclusions for:\n- Temporary files (*.log, build.log, fix-errors.sh)\n- SDD artifacts (.atl/)\n- Already had docs/ excluded","tree":{"sha":"65eeb8d95b68c890bcb492e6cd30dc047d4512b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/trees/65eeb8d95b68c890bcb492e6cd30dc047d4512b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/commits/330ef457b1d62f8e7fe75376488cbba0cfee4d36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/330ef457b1d62f8e7fe75376488cbba0cfee4d36","node_id":"C_kwDOR-aH6toAKDMzMGVmNDU3YjFkNjJmOGU3ZmU3NTM3NjQ4OGNiYmEwY2ZlZTRkMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/d76bb5511bce9e6ac6e856ede17f7b8a22d4ffcb","sha":"d76bb5511bce9e6ac6e856ede17f7b8a22d4ffcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/d76bb5511bce9e6ac6e856ede17f7b8a22d4ffcb"}],"sha":"330ef457b1d62f8e7fe75376488cbba0cfee4d36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/330ef457b1d62f8e7fe75376488cbba0cfee4d36"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/d76bb5511bce9e6ac6e856ede17f7b8a22d4ffcb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T14:09:43Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T14:09:43Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"message":"fix: Login form validation show errors only after touch/submit\n\nFixed validation error messages appearing immediately on page load.\nNow errors only show after:\n- User interacts with field (touched), OR\n- Form is submitted (submitted flag)\n\nChanges:\n- Added submitted signal to track form submission\n- Modified getEmailError() to check touched or submitted\n- Modified getPasswordError() to check touched or submitted\n- Updated .gitignore to exclude temporary files (.log, .sh)\n\nAlso removed build.log and fix-errors.sh temporary files.","tree":{"sha":"c0c7b7c073480cc881dc2abb25ba768d85e54524","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/trees/c0c7b7c073480cc881dc2abb25ba768d85e54524"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/commits/d76bb5511bce9e6ac6e856ede17f7b8a22d4ffcb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/d76bb5511bce9e6ac6e856ede17f7b8a22d4ffcb","node_id":"C_kwDOR-aH6toAKGQ3NmJiNTUxMWJjZTllNmFjNmU4NTZlZGUxN2Y3YjhhMjJkNGZmY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/7deffedcf85b649be73c0271a2a3be4a56dba812","sha":"7deffedcf85b649be73c0271a2a3be4a56dba812","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/7deffedcf85b649be73c0271a2a3be4a56dba812"}],"sha":"d76bb5511bce9e6ac6e856ede17f7b8a22d4ffcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/d76bb5511bce9e6ac6e856ede17f7b8a22d4ffcb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commits/7deffedcf85b649be73c0271a2a3be4a56dba812/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T14:03:10Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T14:03:10Z","email":"anarvaez@DESKTOP-T6AP74P.localdomain","name":"Aldray Narvaez"},"message":"fix: Correct logo.png path for Angular 21 asset handling\n\nFixed logo path from /assets/images/logo.png to /images/logo.png.\n\nAngular 21+ new builder copies src/assets to dist/browser/ root,\nnot dist/browser/assets/. The correct path is /images/logo.png.\n\nChanges:\n- angular.json: Added src/assets to assets configuration\n- sidebar.component.html: Changed ngSrc to /images/logo.png\n- auth-layout.component.html: Changed ngSrc to /images/logo.png\n\nLogo now appears correctly in both sidebar and login page.","tree":{"sha":"a8a98096a4afb8b6d0ee006177697069383a35e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/trees/a8a98096a4afb8b6d0ee006177697069383a35e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/git/commits/7deffedcf85b649be73c0271a2a3be4a56dba812","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/7deffedcf85b649be73c0271a2a3be4a56dba812","node_id":"C_kwDOR-aH6toAKDdkZWZmZWRjZjg1YjY0OWJlNzNjMDI3MWEyYTNiZTRhNTZkYmE4MTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DjAldrinho/foodie-connect-admin/commit/86b43f5dca1b72b693ca3eb939ab83c3add759ef","sha":"86b43f5dca1b72b693ca3eb939ab83c3add759ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DjAldrinho/foodie-con