committedDate":"2026-04-10T01:14:43Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"citadel@Mac.lan","name":"Citadel AI"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:33:54.673Z","repositoryId":1206492805,"sha":"8d27b86d947e0afd8dae497e9160cc93f5ae77f5"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"citadel@Mac.lan","name":"Citadel AI"},"authoredDate":"2026-04-10T01:04:48Z","committedDate":"2026-04-10T01:04:48Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"citadel@Mac.lan","name":"Citadel AI"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:33:54.673Z","repositoryId":1206492805,"sha":"464560bf6a179f9bed03236e575ff164f64519b3"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:33:54.673Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/8873a47dee06153fcdd67d375c5a5ede2803db12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-29T22:26:18Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T22:26:18Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Rehaul bullet-time: rare, lane-gated, with cooldown\n\nOld behavior: scan window 4-130 segs over 3600+ segs at 0.05-0.07\nhazard rate meant ~6 hazards always in scan window, slow-mo locked on.\nVegas was a permanent slow-mo tunnel.\n\nNew behavior:\n- State machine: idle -> active -> cooldown (2s real-time lockout)\n- Tight reaction zone: 20-75 segs ahead (~0.4-0.8s real at 100mph)\n- Lane gate: only fires if hazard sits within 0.55 of player''s X (the\n  lane you''d actually drive into), not just anywhere on the road\n- Hazard density cut 15-20x: Atlanta 0.07->0.004, Manhattan 0.06->0.004,\n  Vegas 0.05->0.003. ~12-17 hazards per lap instead of 180+\n- Default rate 0.035 -> 0.002\n\nNow slow-mo fires as a discrete event when an obstacle is in your line,\ngives you ~4-8 stretched seconds to react, then releases and locks out\nso a debris cluster doesn''t produce one continuous slow-mo soup.","tree":{"sha":"d2f98ea264854d24f11d33700078d2a32074b537","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/d2f98ea264854d24f11d33700078d2a32074b537"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/8873a47dee06153fcdd67d375c5a5ede2803db12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/8873a47dee06153fcdd67d375c5a5ede2803db12","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDg4NzNhNDdkZWUwNjE1M2ZjZGQ2N2QzNzVjNWE1ZWRlMjgwM2RiMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/c2f67ef62d391bf5aaa2698600f2c0e94cd776f4","sha":"c2f67ef62d391bf5aaa2698600f2c0e94cd776f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/c2f67ef62d391bf5aaa2698600f2c0e94cd776f4"}],"sha":"8873a47dee06153fcdd67d375c5a5ede2803db12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/8873a47dee06153fcdd67d375c5a5ede2803db12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/c2f67ef62d391bf5aaa2698600f2c0e94cd776f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T14:37:58Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T14:37:58Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Enable bullet-time in qualify, not just race\n\nQualify hazards are identical to race hazards and qualify is the player''s\nfirst impression of a track. Gating slow-mo to race-only meant the first\nNYC drive was \"100mph into every pothole with no reaction time\" — which\nis exactly the complaint.","tree":{"sha":"c8d8c8a5df571f4608fa1ad7adc52cb5b1f8c607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/c8d8c8a5df571f4608fa1ad7adc52cb5b1f8c607"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/c2f67ef62d391bf5aaa2698600f2c0e94cd776f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/c2f67ef62d391bf5aaa2698600f2c0e94cd776f4","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKGMyZjY3ZWY2MmQzOTFiZjVhYWEyNjk4NjAwZjJjMGU5NGNkNzc2ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/f3555fc73dd1d5ec4aa043a39758f8b0bc2502d4","sha":"f3555fc73dd1d5ec4aa043a39758f8b0bc2502d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/f3555fc73dd1d5ec4aa043a39758f8b0bc2502d4"}],"sha":"c2f67ef62d391bf5aaa2698600f2c0e94cd776f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/c2f67ef62d391bf5aaa2698600f2c0e94cd776f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/f3555fc73dd1d5ec4aa043a39758f8b0bc2502d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T03:10:44Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T03:10:44Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Add live debug HUD to diagnose NYC bullet-time\n\n?debug=1 now paints a top-right readout every 200ms showing bulletTime,\ntotal hazards on the track, hazards in the 4..130-seg detection window,\nand the nearest-ahead seg distance. If BT stays at 1.00 on Manhattan\nwhile HAZ>0 somewhere ahead, the scan is broken. If HAZ total is 0,\n_spawnHazards isn''t running. Either way the next fix is unambiguous.","tree":{"sha":"21996723d13c0ccfb4df29716f9b64fb3edd7c50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/21996723d13c0ccfb4df29716f9b64fb3edd7c50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/f3555fc73dd1d5ec4aa043a39758f8b0bc2502d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/f3555fc73dd1d5ec4aa043a39758f8b0bc2502d4","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKGYzNTU1ZmM3M2RkMWQ1ZWM0YWEwNDNhMzk3NThmOGIwYmMyNTAyZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/7df94eb94f90d033e852f1dc223a2c2eeacf76a3","sha":"7df94eb94f90d033e852f1dc223a2c2eeacf76a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/7df94eb94f90d033e852f1dc223a2c2eeacf76a3"}],"sha":"f3555fc73dd1d5ec4aa043a39758f8b0bc2502d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/f3555fc73dd1d5ec4aa043a39758f8b0bc2502d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/7df94eb94f90d033e852f1dc223a2c2eeacf76a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T02:32:42Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T02:32:42Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Spawn enough hazards for bullet-time to actually trigger\n\nDefault rate was 0.015 → ~2.7 hazards on a 180-seg track, minus noop\nfilter lands around 2 hazards per race. You can drive a full lap without\none entering the 130-seg detection window, which is why bullet-time\nnever fired in Manhattan.\n\n- Default rate: 0.015 → 0.035 (~3x more hazards across the board)\n- Manhattan: 0.06 — NYC streets, potholes everywhere\n- Vegas: 0.05 — Strip debris\n\nAtlanta I-285 already at 0.07.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce9be27732f1c45e0640e993f8a1535608878e17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/ce9be27732f1c45e0640e993f8a1535608878e17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/7df94eb94f90d033e852f1dc223a2c2eeacf76a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/7df94eb94f90d033e852f1dc223a2c2eeacf76a3","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDdkZjk0ZWI5NGY5MGQwMzNlODUyZjFkYzIyM2EyYzJlZWFjZjc2YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/9ca8b0692d3df95ee69302fd40b778359de60ae0","sha":"9ca8b0692d3df95ee69302fd40b778359de60ae0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/9ca8b0692d3df95ee69302fd40b778359de60ae0"}],"sha":"7df94eb94f90d033e852f1dc223a2c2eeacf76a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/7df94eb94f90d033e852f1dc223a2c2eeacf76a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/9ca8b0692d3df95ee69302fd40b778359de60ae0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T02:29:26Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T02:29:26Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Crank bullet-time to 0.10 — 100 mph feels like 10 mph\n\nPrevious 0.25 still felt like highway speed; debris whipped past before\nthe player could react. Drop to 0.10 so the world literally moves at\n1/10 speed when a hazard comes into view. Widen the detection window\nfrom 90 to 130 segs and the trigger threshold down to speed > 0.20 so\nslow-mo kicks in sooner and lingers long enough to steer around.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9cb2680335827db531ca0b8862a31e13893f6efc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/9cb2680335827db531ca0b8862a31e13893f6efc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/9ca8b0692d3df95ee69302fd40b778359de60ae0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/9ca8b0692d3df95ee69302fd40b778359de60ae0","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDljYThiMDY5MmQzZGY5NWVlNjkzMDJmZDQwYjc3ODM1OWRlNjBhZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/3b29ad6692104fe640154f5ce1280d89d8bfd733","sha":"3b29ad6692104fe640154f5ce1280d89d8bfd733","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/3b29ad6692104fe640154f5ce1280d89d8bfd733"}],"sha":"9ca8b0692d3df95ee69302fd40b778359de60ae0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/9ca8b0692d3df95ee69302fd40b778359de60ae0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/3b29ad6692104fe640154f5ce1280d89d8bfd733/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T02:22:40Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T02:22:40Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Fix hazard tunneling at highway speeds\n\nAt 100 mph (speed=1.0), dt=0.016s moves playerZ by ~1.44 segments per\nframe. _checkHazardCollision was checking a single segment, so debris,\npotholes, and tires sitting on a segment the player skipped entirely\nproduced zero interaction — the car drove straight through.\n\nWiden the check to sweep every segment in the swept path this frame\n(capped at 8 as a sanity guard against dt spikes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e64418f0899e53e797a58287663cc1478664f96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/5e64418f0899e53e797a58287663cc1478664f96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/3b29ad6692104fe640154f5ce1280d89d8bfd733","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/3b29ad6692104fe640154f5ce1280d89d8bfd733","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDNiMjlhZDY2OTIxMDRmZTY0MDE1NGY1Y2UxMjgwZDg5ZDhiZmQ3MzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/978d39c2aba43e5d15c659bf539ebc8b2d836aad","sha":"978d39c2aba43e5d15c659bf539ebc8b2d836aad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/978d39c2aba43e5d15c659bf539ebc8b2d836aad"}],"sha":"3b29ad6692104fe640154f5ce1280d89d8bfd733","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/3b29ad6692104fe640154f5ce1280d89d8bfd733"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/978d39c2aba43e5d15c659bf539ebc8b2d836aad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T02:18:22Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T02:18:22Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Make bullet-time visible; spawn real hazards on I-285\n\nThree fixes to the same problem: \"I never see bullet-time engage.\"\n\n- Add a magenta SLOW-MO pill indicator driven by bulletTime < 0.9\n  so the trigger state is obvious at a glance.\n- Widen bullet-time scan (4–90 segs, was 5–70) and drop the factor\n  to 0.25, giving ~4s of effective reaction at 100 mph.\n- Atlanta I-285 listed ''traffic_heavy'' as a hazard entry — density hint,\n  not a sprite. Filter noop types in _spawnHazards and bump Atlanta''s\n  hazardSpawnRate to 0.07 so ~14 hazards land across 210 segs.\n\nAlso tighten player avoidance: traffic uses tc.x (actual mid-change\nposition) not LANES[tc.lane] (target) to test lane proximity, so cars\nmid-lane-change no longer slice through the player.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8eb050b603e1eb8ee091e0e61f032e18eb59637f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/8eb050b603e1eb8ee091e0e61f032e18eb59637f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/978d39c2aba43e5d15c659bf539ebc8b2d836aad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/978d39c2aba43e5d15c659bf539ebc8b2d836aad","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDk3OGQzOWMyYWJhNDNlNWQxNWM2NTliZjUzOWViYzhiMmQ4MzZhYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/fb32a1e398e89d8da4840e5b7e48fdf226dcbd50","sha":"fb32a1e398e89d8da4840e5b7e48fdf226dcbd50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/fb32a1e398e89d8da4840e5b7e48fdf226dcbd50"}],"sha":"978d39c2aba43e5d15c659bf539ebc8b2d836aad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/978d39c2aba43e5d15c659bf539ebc8b2d836aad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/fb32a1e398e89d8da4840e5b7e48fdf226dcbd50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T02:06:26Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T02:06:26Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Longer hazard slow-mo window + traffic queues behind player\n\nBullet-time widened:\n- Scan window 8–28 → 5–70 segs (real window ~0.72s @ 100 mph)\n- Factor 0.40 → 0.30 (effective reaction ~2.4s)\n- Lower speed gate: 0.50 → 0.35 (kicks in on moderate-speed tracks too)\n\nTraffic queues behind the player:\n- When traffic is blocked by the player in the same lane and\n  _pickLaneChange finds no open adjacent lane, traffic now\n  speed-matches the player (down to zero if the player is\n  stopped) instead of driving through.\n\nBumps game.js v=110 → v=111.","tree":{"sha":"b50e788767002f5772a170436c0239df9c1925d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/b50e788767002f5772a170436c0239df9c1925d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/fb32a1e398e89d8da4840e5b7e48fdf226dcbd50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/fb32a1e398e89d8da4840e5b7e48fdf226dcbd50","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKGZiMzJhMWUzOThlODlkOGRhNDg0MGU1YjdlNDhmZGYyMjZkY2JkNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/26ee86d82444efccc78d438cd8b7518e771d411c","sha":"26ee86d82444efccc78d438cd8b7518e771d411c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/26ee86d82444efccc78d438cd8b7518e771d411c"}],"sha":"fb32a1e398e89d8da4840e5b7e48fdf226dcbd50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/fb32a1e398e89d8da4840e5b7e48fdf226dcbd50"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/26ee86d82444efccc78d438cd8b7518e771d411c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-24T01:55:26Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-24T01:55:26Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Whole-number finish pos, per-race points, hazard bullet-time\n\nThree fixes:\n\n1. _updatePosition smooths toward rank via 0.15 lerp, leaving\n   `position` as a float (e.g. 4.7). Leaderboard.record stored\n   the float and PTS[4.7-1] returned undefined, so every race\n   awarded 0 points. _finishRace now rounds to an integer in\n   [1..TOTAL_RACERS] before the payload.\n\n2. Added Leaderboard.pointsFor(pos) so game.js and getTotalPoints\n   share one source of truth (P1=10 / P2=7 / P3=5 / P4=3 / P5=1).\n   Results body now shows PTS: +N next to LAPS.\n\n3. Bullet-time: game loop scans 8–28 segs ahead for hazards.\n   When a pothole/tire/debris/oil/ice/cone is in that window\n   and the player''s moving, dt ramps to 0.40× (2.5× reaction\n   time). Slow-mo ramps use real dt so it doesn''t slow itself.\n   At 100 mph, a hazard now gets ~0.6s of visible reaction\n   time instead of ~0.25s.\n\nBumps game.js v=109→110, tracks.js v=104→105, ui.js v=100→101.","tree":{"sha":"e1197a2cd3d9ee7f8a5062053262ab33e308af3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/e1197a2cd3d9ee7f8a5062053262ab33e308af3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/26ee86d82444efccc78d438cd8b7518e771d411c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/26ee86d82444efccc78d438cd8b7518e771d411c","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDI2ZWU4NmQ4MjQ0NGVmY2NjNzhkNDM4Y2Q4Yjc1MThlNzcxZDQxMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/44a6ee6592644e60ba7512cc1195ae699d58fa2c","sha":"44a6ee6592644e60ba7512cc1195ae699d58fa2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/44a6ee6592644e60ba7512cc1195ae699d58fa2c"}],"sha":"26ee86d82444efccc78d438cd8b7518e771d411c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/26ee86d82444efccc78d438cd8b7518e771d411c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/44a6ee6592644e60ba7512cc1195ae699d58fa2c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T17:45:23Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T17:45:23Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Atlanta: traffic weaves again, but via lane change\n\nRemoved trafficLockLanes flag entirely. Traffic that needs to\npass (slower car in same lane, or the player) picks an open\nadjacent lane and changes. Speed-match remains as a fallback\nwhen no lane is open.\n\nRear-end guard (playerSpeed > tc.speed) stays as a safety net —\nif traffic can''t find a lane and is closing fast, the player\ndoesn''t get punished with a crash.\n\nBumps tracks.js v=103 → v=104, game.js v=108 → v=109.","tree":{"sha":"1d4a415c5a6afe5ab77180681ab1d9035cd9d2a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/1d4a415c5a6afe5ab77180681ab1d9035cd9d2a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/44a6ee6592644e60ba7512cc1195ae699d58fa2c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/44a6ee6592644e60ba7512cc1195ae699d58fa2c","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDQ0YTZlZTY1OTI2NDRlNjBiYTc1MTJjYzExOTVhZTY5OWQ1OGZhMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/38d2672dcfc2e30e4e26c84b90b923bf3178ae1d","sha":"38d2672dcfc2e30e4e26c84b90b923bf3178ae1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/38d2672dcfc2e30e4e26c84b90b923bf3178ae1d"}],"sha":"44a6ee6592644e60ba7512cc1195ae699d58fa2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/44a6ee6592644e60ba7512cc1195ae699d58fa2c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/38d2672dcfc2e30e4e26c84b90b923bf3178ae1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T17:42:49Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T17:42:49Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Three-lane road + no rear-end crashes from trailing traffic\n\nTwo bugs shipped together:\n\n1) Road only has dividers at ±0.33, giving 3 lanes, not 4. I had\n   LANES = [-0.665, -0.165, 0.165, 0.665] which put two cars\n   side-by-side in the middle lane. Fixed to [-0.665, 0, 0.665].\n\n2) Player getting hit from behind on Atlanta. The collision\n   window (segDiff < 4) fires the moment traffic crosses into\n   the player''s segment — including when slower-player is being\n   rear-ended by faster lane-locked traffic. Added a guard:\n   collision only registers when playerSpeed > tc.speed (i.e.\n   the player is catching the traffic, not vice versa).\n\nBumps game.js v=107 → v=108.","tree":{"sha":"881690c6de2de92dddbac3685b07979e29bf7fbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/881690c6de2de92dddbac3685b07979e29bf7fbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/38d2672dcfc2e30e4e26c84b90b923bf3178ae1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/38d2672dcfc2e30e4e26c84b90b923bf3178ae1d","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDM4ZDI2NzJkY2ZjMmUzMGU0ZTI2Yzg0YjkwYjkyM2JmMzE3OGFlMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/86ab4e4e6259a649d90a3658af4102b8058fe4dc","sha":"86ab4e4e6259a649d90a3658af4102b8058fe4dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/86ab4e4e6259a649d90a3658af4102b8058fe4dc"}],"sha":"38d2672dcfc2e30e4e26c84b90b923bf3178ae1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/38d2672dcfc2e30e4e26c84b90b923bf3178ae1d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/86ab4e4e6259a649d90a3658af4102b8058fe4dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T17:33:07Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T17:33:07Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Align traffic with actual lane centers\n\nTraffic was landing on the lane dividers instead of in the lanes:\n- Road dividers draw at ±0.33 (normalized road-width units)\n- LANES were [-0.65,-0.32,0.32,0.65] then multiplied by 0.62 in\n  the renderer, putting cars at ±0.40 and ±0.20 — right on or\n  next to the divider lines\n\nFix: use real lane-center midpoints and drop the 0.62 multiplier.\nNow sprite.lane shares the same normalized units as playerX.\n\n- LANES = [-0.665, -0.165, 0.165, 0.665]\n- renderer: laneOffset = sprite.lane * sRW (clamp relaxed to ±0.85)\n\nBumps game.js v=106 → v=107, renderer.js v=104 → v=105.","tree":{"sha":"14f5306e56e572b521fcc5026d49598ffdcedc3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/14f5306e56e572b521fcc5026d49598ffdcedc3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/86ab4e4e6259a649d90a3658af4102b8058fe4dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/86ab4e4e6259a649d90a3658af4102b8058fe4dc","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDg2YWI0ZTRlNjI1OWE2NDlkOTBhMzY1OGFmNDEwMmI4MDU4ZmU0ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/d8f240f69848803d6c5d3c3fa83195969ecc2900","sha":"d8f240f69848803d6c5d3c3fa83195969ecc2900","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/d8f240f69848803d6c5d3c3fa83195969ecc2900"}],"sha":"86ab4e4e6259a649d90a3658af4102b8058fe4dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/86ab4e4e6259a649d90a3658af4102b8058fe4dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/d8f240f69848803d6c5d3c3fa83195969ecc2900/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T17:28:32Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T17:28:32Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Atlanta: lock traffic into constant lanes, only player weaves\n\nNew per-track flag track.trafficLockLanes. When set:\n- Traffic never initiates a lane change (same-lane blocker? just\n  speed-match and queue up)\n- Player-avoidance skipped — traffic doesn''t dodge the player\n- Speed-matching still runs so cars don''t drive through each other\n- Only the player changes lanes\n\nAtlanta I-285 sets the flag — true rush-hour vibe, you pick the\ngap and thread through the gridlock.\n\nBumps tracks.js v=102 → v=103, game.js v=105 → v=106.","tree":{"sha":"4e942b049f139eea74becb05d406ce02a76513a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/4e942b049f139eea74becb05d406ce02a76513a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/d8f240f69848803d6c5d3c3fa83195969ecc2900","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/d8f240f69848803d6c5d3c3fa83195969ecc2900","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKGQ4ZjI0MGY2OTg0ODgwM2Q2YzVkM2MzZmE4MzE5NTk2OWVjYzI5MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/ff4b7349b351737e01fe27f4adcc7488f9e6c52a","sha":"ff4b7349b351737e01fe27f4adcc7488f9e6c52a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/ff4b7349b351737e01fe27f4adcc7488f9e6c52a"}],"sha":"d8f240f69848803d6c5d3c3fa83195969ecc2900","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/d8f240f69848803d6c5d3c3fa83195969ecc2900"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/ff4b7349b351737e01fe27f4adcc7488f9e6c52a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T17:26:24Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T17:26:24Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Atlanta I-285 — 20x traffic density, 40 mph speed cap\n\nTurn Atlanta into actual rush-hour gridlock:\n\n- trafficDensity 0.90 → 18.0 (~20x, ~1890 cars on the 4200-seg loop)\n- new track.trafficSpeedCap = 0.40 (40 mph max)\n- _spawnTraffic clamps spd.min/max to [cap*0.5, cap] when set,\n  giving 20-40 mph stop-and-go variance while keeping the lane\n  discipline + collision AI honest\n\nNote: 20x density × O(N) same-lane lookup per car is ~3.6M ops/\nframe. If perf drops on Atlanta, next step is to bucket traffic\nby lane once per frame before the update loop.\n\nBumps tracks.js v=101 → v=102, game.js v=104 → v=105.","tree":{"sha":"e32778fb13d7ddf558344898bc69457c2d6bea05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/e32778fb13d7ddf558344898bc69457c2d6bea05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/ff4b7349b351737e01fe27f4adcc7488f9e6c52a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/ff4b7349b351737e01fe27f4adcc7488f9e6c52a","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKGZmNGI3MzQ5YjM1MTczN2UwMWZlMjdmNGFkY2M3NDg4ZjllNmM1MmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/0ce0829c8d3774cfce24a6e302f82e2811511e99","sha":"0ce0829c8d3774cfce24a6e302f82e2811511e99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/0ce0829c8d3774cfce24a6e302f82e2811511e99"}],"sha":"ff4b7349b351737e01fe27f4adcc7488f9e6c52a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/ff4b7349b351737e01fe27f4adcc7488f9e6c52a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/0ce0829c8d3774cfce24a6e302f82e2811511e99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T17:22:28Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T17:22:28Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Add ?unlock=all dev shortcut\n\nAppending ?unlock=all to the URL unlocks every tier and both\nprize cars (Ferrari 458 via Atlanta, Cobra 427 via Vegas), then\nstrips the query from the URL via history.replaceState so a\nnormal reload doesn''t re-trigger.\n\nBumps tracks.js v=100 → v=101.","tree":{"sha":"13365c32968f19bd57a5257d0a5021924c952cc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/13365c32968f19bd57a5257d0a5021924c952cc3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/0ce0829c8d3774cfce24a6e302f82e2811511e99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/0ce0829c8d3774cfce24a6e302f82e2811511e99","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDBjZTA4MjljOGQzNzc0Y2ZjZTI0YTZlMzAyZjgyZTI4MTE1MTFlOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/683f924bd69623f70203924848e646efc8f683c0","sha":"683f924bd69623f70203924848e646efc8f683c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/683f924bd69623f70203924848e646efc8f683c0"}],"sha":"0ce0829c8d3774cfce24a6e302f82e2811511e99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/0ce0829c8d3774cfce24a6e302f82e2811511e99"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/683f924bd69623f70203924848e646efc8f683c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T17:19:02Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T17:19:02Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Add lane discipline + traffic-vs-traffic collision AI\n\nTraffic now rides in one of four discrete lanes and actively\navoids running through other cars:\n\n- LANES[-0.65, -0.32, 0.32, 0.65] — discrete lane centers\n- Each car stores tc.lane (index) instead of free-floating tc.x\n- _nearestInLane / _nearestBehindInLane for neighbor lookup\n- _pickLaneChange picks the adjacent lane with most headroom\n  and a safe gap behind\n- If a slower car blocks within 8 segs: try lane change, else\n  speed-match when dist<3 so we don''t overrun mid-interpolation\n- 1.5s _laneCooldown debounce prevents lane-flicker\n- Player-avoidance rewritten to use discrete lane change\n  instead of continuous tc.x nudging\n- tc.x interpolates toward LANES[tc.lane] at 4/s so sprites\n  glide between lanes instead of snapping\n\nBumps game.js cache-bust v=103 → v=104.","tree":{"sha":"a9ac28f672735cf297b97c3726164b0e326a0a29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/a9ac28f672735cf297b97c3726164b0e326a0a29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/683f924bd69623f70203924848e646efc8f683c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/683f924bd69623f70203924848e646efc8f683c0","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDY4M2Y5MjRiZDY5NjIzZjcwMjAzOTI0ODQ4ZTY0NmVmYzhmNjgzYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/a9436daa248ebe34dc6d905828e044de266bc99f","sha":"a9436daa248ebe34dc6d905828e044de266bc99f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/a9436daa248ebe34dc6d905828e044de266bc99f"}],"sha":"683f924bd69623f70203924848e646efc8f683c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/683f924bd69623f70203924848e646efc8f683c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/a9436daa248ebe34dc6d905828e044de266bc99f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T16:54:10Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T16:54:10Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Halve player acceleration so traffic matters\n\naccel constant 0.7 → 0.35. Ferrari was hitting top speed in 1.7s, so the\nplayer blew through traffic before the density had a chance to matter.\nNew rates across the roster: Ferrari ~3.4s, SL550 ~3.7s, CLS ~4.0s,\nRaptor/GX ~5s, Cobra ~3.2s. Nitro still doubles the rate, so boost\nbursts remain snappy.\n\nBumps game.js → v=103.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"67ccf28fece9beac0cdee2c0d356f9fd65160185","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/67ccf28fece9beac0cdee2c0d356f9fd65160185"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/a9436daa248ebe34dc6d905828e044de266bc99f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/a9436daa248ebe34dc6d905828e044de266bc99f","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKGE5NDM2ZGFhMjQ4ZWJlMzRkYzZkOTA1ODI4ZTA0NGRlMjY2YmM5OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/9be35d5a90318596144eb7334615e2794cdf1fef","sha":"9be35d5a90318596144eb7334615e2794cdf1fef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/9be35d5a90318596144eb7334615e2794cdf1fef"}],"sha":"a9436daa248ebe34dc6d905828e044de266bc99f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/a9436daa248ebe34dc6d905828e044de266bc99f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/9be35d5a90318596144eb7334615e2794cdf1fef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T16:42:56Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T16:42:56Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Smooth traffic motion + bump sprite size at close range\n\nTwo follow-up fixes after the first pass still showed \"jerky when nearby\"\nand \"smaller than expected\":\n\n1. Proper sub-proj interpolation. Previous pass interpolated between\n   segClosest(curSeg) and segClosest(nextSeg) — but at close range\n   (proj step=0.15) one segment spans ~7 proj entries, and linear blend\n   between two endpoints drifts ~12% of roadH off the true 1/n curve.\n   Sprites appeared to snap as they crossed proj samples. Now we pass\n   the sprite''s true n (distance from camera in segment-space) from\n   game.js and linearly interpolate between the two proj entries that\n   bracket it — so the error is bounded by step (0.15 n), not 1.0.\n\n2. Size clamp relaxed. sw = min(sRW*0.38, W*0.22) read too small next\n   to the player HUD at close range. Bumped to min(sRW*0.48, W*0.35)\n   so a traffic car roughly fills a lane at proximity.\n\nBumps renderer.js → v=104, game.js → v=102.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"804102bcddb30740b904c384909c998c2d7b3022","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/804102bcddb30740b904c384909c998c2d7b3022"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/9be35d5a90318596144eb7334615e2794cdf1fef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/9be35d5a90318596144eb7334615e2794cdf1fef","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDliZTM1ZDVhOTAzMTg1OTYxNDRlYjczMzQ2MTVlMjc5NGNkZjFmZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/7d6db468238da3b5712509d210e69935619e358a","sha":"7d6db468238da3b5712509d210e69935619e358a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/7d6db468238da3b5712509d210e69935619e358a"}],"sha":"9be35d5a90318596144eb7334615e2794cdf1fef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/9be35d5a90318596144eb7334615e2794cdf1fef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/7d6db468238da3b5712509d210e69935619e358a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T14:15:25Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T14:15:25Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Fix traffic jumping: correct zFrac + interpolate to NEXT segment\n\nTwo bugs caused sprites to snap between two Y positions as they approached:\n\n1. zFrac used `dNow % 1` (distance-from-player fractional part). When dNow\n   crossed an integer boundary, zFrac jumped 0.99→0.01 even though the\n   traffic car''s own sub-segment position barely moved. Now uses `tc.z -\n   floor(tc.z)` — the car''s actual fractional offset within its segment.\n\n2. Interpolation used `proj[i+1]` as the \"far\" endpoint. At close range\n   proj step is 0.15, so proj[i+1] is the same segment ~0.15 units farther\n   — not the next segment at all. Interpolation only covered a sliver of\n   the sprite''s true Y range, so sprites snapped from \"barely moved from\n   seg N''s near-Y\" to \"seg N+1''s near-Y\" when tc.z crossed. Now looks up\n   the proj entry for segment index+1 via segClosest.\n\nBumps renderer.js to v=103, game.js to v=101.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d0a1ececfb9067063277d750d650efc6216e365","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/5d0a1ececfb9067063277d750d650efc6216e365"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/7d6db468238da3b5712509d210e69935619e358a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/7d6db468238da3b5712509d210e69935619e358a","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDdkNmRiNDY4MjM4ZGEzYjU3MTI1MDlkMjEwZTY5OTM1NjE5ZTM1OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/d737990246fbd921231ffca916d4e399b5e6eed4","sha":"d737990246fbd921231ffca916d4e399b5e6eed4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/d737990246fbd921231ffca916d4e399b5e6eed4"}],"sha":"7d6db468238da3b5712509d210e69935619e358a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/7d6db468238da3b5712509d210e69935619e358a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/d737990246fbd921231ffca916d4e399b5e6eed4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T14:07:46Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T14:07:46Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Fix traffic flicker: drop n<1.1 skip that nuked close cars\n\nThe per-sprite guard `if (sprite.type === ''car'' && cur.n < 1.1) continue;`\nkilled traffic in the nearest projection step. Since proj n starts at 1\nand fluctuates frame-to-frame as cars approach, sprites flashed\npresent/absent across the 1.1 boundary — looked like see-through / low-FPS\nglitch when user said \"when traffic gets close, they are basically see\nthrough.\" sw is already clamped to W*0.22 so no size blow-up risk.\n\nBumps renderer.js cache-bust to v=102.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ebd4eae5c13b1e095c8518eabf55f4fae45f3e08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/ebd4eae5c13b1e095c8518eabf55f4fae45f3e08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/d737990246fbd921231ffca916d4e399b5e6eed4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/d737990246fbd921231ffca916d4e399b5e6eed4","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKGQ3Mzc5OTAyNDZmYmQ5MjEyMzFmZmNhOTE2ZDRlMzk5YjVlNmVlZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/c6a40f10a7f0134112d79d94820c5ec7fa1b6c90","sha":"c6a40f10a7f0134112d79d94820c5ec7fa1b6c90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/c6a40f10a7f0134112d79d94820c5ec7fa1b6c90"}],"sha":"d737990246fbd921231ffca916d4e399b5e6eed4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/d737990246fbd921231ffca916d4e399b5e6eed4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/c6a40f10a7f0134112d79d94820c5ec7fa1b6c90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T13:51:34Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T13:51:34Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Ground traffic sprites to the road surface\n\nThe ''car'' branch of _drawSprite drew with ctx.drawImage(..., -dw/2, -dh/2, ...)\n(centered at origin), but the caller passes y = sY - sh using scenery convention\n(y = top of box, y + h = ground level). Result: every traffic sprite''s center\nlanded where its bottom should be, floating cars ~0.83*sw above the road — most\nvisible at Atlanta I-285''s heavy traffic density where a pickup truck appeared\nsuspended mid-air over the tarmac.\n\nFix: draw with bottom pinned at h (and center the fallback at h/2 to match).\nBump renderer.js cache-bust to v=101 so returning players pull the fix.\n\nAlso: add .gstack/ to .gitignore — QA reports aren''t source.","tree":{"sha":"6a35bbf40145a8c12f0c7653d63dd980bef4f26c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/6a35bbf40145a8c12f0c7653d63dd980bef4f26c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/c6a40f10a7f0134112d79d94820c5ec7fa1b6c90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ci