n_hour (Tulum), partly_cloudy\n- One-time save migration (progress/leaderboard/prize keys → _v2,\n  tuning preserved at _v1)\n- Orlando castle is deliberately generic (4 towers, no Disney IP)\n- GitHub Pages deploy workflow via actions/deploy-pages@v4\n- Cache-bust v83 → v100\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"782a1717ec8a5cfda24ef6d8cf874e787a48e99a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/782a1717ec8a5cfda24ef6d8cf874e787a48e99a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/71d501416a91df8cf01d27f62b603eb48be309c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/71d501416a91df8cf01d27f62b603eb48be309c2","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDcxZDUwMTQxNmE5MWRmOGNmMDFkMjdmNjJiNjAzZWI0OGJlMzA5YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com