dd StorageKeys + GameConstants registries\n- prize unlock: #screen-cobra-prize → shared #screen-prize-unlock; PrizeUnlock\n  map-backed with legacy vr_cobra_v1 migration; Ferrari 458 joins Cobra as prize\n- ui.js: generic UI.confirm() modal replaces native confirm()\n- audio.js: vr_audio_v1 persists enabled/musicVol/sfxVol across sessions\n- index.html: enrich debug overlay with Game.getDebugSnapshot() on crash\n- bump cache-bust to v=83\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1853a378d1815e5fe210fdb51c353f5d067d60b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/1853a378d1815e5fe210fdb51c353f5d067d60b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/df4e3e51115edf5de7f6c107b9325e4496599244","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/df4e3e51115edf5de7f6c107b9325e4496599244","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKGRmNGUzZTUxMTE1ZWRmNWRlN2Y2YzEwN2I5MzI1ZTQ0OTY1OTkyNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/78d71fe9117dc03b31469bdfdbaa22eb92874fbf","sha":"78d71fe9117dc03b31469bdfdbaa22eb92874fbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/78d71fe9117dc03b31469bdfdbaa22eb92874fbf"}],"sha":"df4e3e51115edf5de7f6c107b9325e4496599244","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/df4e3e51115edf5de7f6c107b9325e4496599244"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/78d71fe9117dc03b31469bdfdbaa22eb92874fbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T12:55:28Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T12:55:28Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Add car tuning presets (STOCK / RACE / RALLY)\n\nTUNE button on car-select cycles three presets per car:\n- STOCK: baseline stats\n- RACE:  +10 top speed, +8 accel, -15 handling, slightly worse off-road\n- RALLY: -10 top speed, +4 accel, +12 handling, dirt penalty x0.55\n\nPreset is persisted per-car in localStorage (vr_tuning_v1) and applied at\nqualify/race start via Tuning.apply(car). Stat bars on the detail panel\nshow the tuned value with ▲/▼ delta arrows next to each bar. Progress\nreset clears tuning alongside unlocks/leaderboard/cobra.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bcc2cfe7571b728976ba3826a9f7f80cb5e7db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/1bcc2cfe7571b728976ba3826a9f7f80cb5e7db5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/78d71fe9117dc03b31469bdfdbaa22eb92874fbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"