om","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Tone down speed lines; gate hazards to slow/heavy-traffic tracks\n\nSpeed lines now only fire during nitro (not throttle-based) and use thin\nhorizontal edge streaks instead of a radial starburst — reads as motion\nwithout the arcade-filter look.\n\nStationary hazards (oil/pothole/debris/tire/cone/ice) only spawn on tracks\nwith dirtZones/iceZones or trafficDensity >= 0.60. On fast highway tracks\nthe player had no reaction time to spot them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b036f0cd90492035af9a643482753b1e8bd6dbdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/b036f0cd90492035af9a643482753b1e8bd6dbdb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/e97730886ce89115e8104bc0f6d895cb25d04932","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/e97730886ce89115e8104bc0f6d895cb25d04932","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKGU5NzczMDg4NmNlODkxMTVlODEwNGJjMGY2ZDg5NWNiMjVkMDQ5MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/75c7cb2489d70ce4f1b6648804263a176bd80fe0","sha":"75c7cb2489d70ce4f1b6648804263a176bd80fe0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/75c7cb2489d70ce4f1b6648804263a176bd80fe0"}],"sha":"e97730886ce89115e8104bc0f6d895cb25d04932","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/e97730886ce89115e8104bc0f6d895cb25d04932"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/75c7cb2489d70ce4f1b6648804263a176bd80fe0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T19:13:43Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T19:13:43Z","email":"citadelai@icloud.com","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Add nitro, combo, draft, minimap + visual FX batch\n\nGameplay:\n- Nitro meter (Shift/Space/N/touch) with +18% top speed + 2x accel\n- Draft buff: +6% accel when tucked behind same-lane traffic\n- Combo multiplier on clean passes (up to 4x nitro refill)\n- Rubber-band AI: traffic speeds adjust ±8% vs baseline\n- Minimap strip showing traffic ahead/behind within ±30 segments\n\nVisual FX (renderer):\n- Speed lines radiating at >60% throttle or during nitro\n- Camera shake on crashes/hazards, decays each frame\n- Distance fog fading far road toward sky color\n- Horizon banking tilts sky into upcoming curves\n- Damage tint + rising smoke above 15% damage\n- Surface-reactive particles (dust on dirt, powder on ice)\n\nEnvironment:\n- track.night flag replaces hardcoded city list\n- Weather: Fuji rain (streaks + slickness), Amalfi fog (heavy haze)\n\nUI:\n- Sector ticks on lap bar + speed-responsive fill color\n- Pause overlay, title-screen trophy, nitro/combo/draft HUD pills\n- Auto-save timer resets on name-input typing\n\nEarlier security/polish (same working set):\n- Cached crash noise buffer, CSP hardening via textContent builders\n- Stable car cards (DOM reuse), keyboard a11y, pause-state routing\n- Ghost delta readout on lap rollover\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74cf6ebb42c481b92c44fa30be6cddd8d70864e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/74cf6ebb42c481b92c44fa30be6cddd8d70864e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/75c7cb2489d70ce4f1b6648804263a176bd80fe0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274569231?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas","id":274569231,"login":"CitadelAI-Atlas","node_id":"U_kgDOEF2YDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CitadelAI-Atlas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/75c7cb2489d70ce4f1b6648804263a176bd80fe0","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDc1YzdjYjI0ODlkNzBjZTRmMWI2NjQ4ODA0MjYzYTE3NmJkODBmZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/c94afd5b93072b07d91a33f8e6441c6c04afce87","sha":"c94afd5b93072b07d91a33f8e6441c6c04afce87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/c94afd5b93072b07d91a33f8e6441c6c04afce87"}],"sha":"75c7cb2489d70ce4f1b6648804263a176bd80fe0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/75c7cb2489d70ce4f1b6648804263a176bd80fe0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/c94afd5b93072b07d91a33f8e6441c6c04afce87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T23:19:31Z","email":"citadel@Mac.lan","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T23:19:31Z","email":"citadel@Mac.lan","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Fix traffic ghost/double-render caused by fractional n stepping\n\nFractional steps (0.15 near player) map the same segment index up to\n5 times in proj[], so sprites were drawn 5x at staggered positions.\nPre-compute each segment''s closest proj index and skip sprite drawing\nfor all duplicate entries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8708b90e017236c80843365d65d701d202bc2019","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/8708b90e017236c80843365d65d701d202bc2019"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/c94afd5b93072b07d91a33f8e6441c6c04afce87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/c94afd5b93072b07d91a33f8e6441c6c04afce87","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKGM5NGFmZDViOTMwNzJiMDdkOTFhMzNmOGU2NDQxYzZjMDRhZmNlODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/5ad1418cc6f7867a344696e4c639188b88aa9b4b","sha":"5ad1418cc6f7867a344696e4c639188b88aa9b4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/5ad1418cc6f7867a344696e4c639188b88aa9b4b"}],"sha":"c94afd5b93072b07d91a33f8e6441c6c04afce87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/c94afd5b93072b07d91a33f8e6441c6c04afce87"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/5ad1418cc6f7867a344696e4c639188b88aa9b4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T23:17:02Z","email":"citadel@Mac.lan","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T23:17:02Z","email":"citadel@Mac.lan","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Add Cobra side sprite for car select prize page\n\n800x241 RGBA transparent PNG registered in sprites.js as cobra_side.\nShows in car detail panel once Cobra is unlocked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3ce3258cad10db4151b5c2545aece690396aa8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/e3ce3258cad10db4151b5c2545aece690396aa8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/5ad1418cc6f7867a344696e4c639188b88aa9b4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/5ad1418cc6f7867a344696e4c639188b88aa9b4b","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDVhZDE0MThjYzZmNzg2N2EzNDQ2OTZlNGM2MzkxODhiODhhYTliNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/ca0a0daa8370f7c3aac4f0ecdefdea942a19db92","sha":"ca0a0daa8370f7c3aac4f0ecdefdea942a19db92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/ca0a0daa8370f7c3aac4f0ecdefdea942a19db92"}],"sha":"5ad1418cc6f7867a344696e4c639188b88aa9b4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/5ad1418cc6f7867a344696e4c639188b88aa9b4b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/ca0a0daa8370f7c3aac4f0ecdefdea942a19db92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T17:22:35Z","email":"citadel@Citadels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T17:22:35Z","email":"citadel@Citadels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Fix default car (SL550) and traffic visibility near player\n\n- selectedCarIndex starts at 1 (SL550) so Family page doesn''t default\n  to the hidden Ferrari\n- Raise traffic n-guard from <2 to <1.1: fractional n stepping made\n  the old threshold hide cars across 7 strips, causing the pop/flicker\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b3713eca8d7151bf8edf8836846966ed6e7c2cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/2b3713eca8d7151bf8edf8836846966ed6e7c2cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/ca0a0daa8370f7c3aac4f0ecdefdea942a19db92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/ca0a0daa8370f7c3aac4f0ecdefdea942a19db92","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKGNhMGEwZGFhODM3MGY3YzNhYWM0ZjBlY2RlZmRlYTk0MmExOWRiOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/19e25f76e25336b9d23aaf61338668b45e8f71cf","sha":"19e25f76e25336b9d23aaf61338668b45e8f71cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/19e25f76e25336b9d23aaf61338668b45e8f71cf"}],"sha":"ca0a0daa8370f7c3aac4f0ecdefdea942a19db92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/ca0a0daa8370f7c3aac4f0ecdefdea942a19db92"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/19e25f76e25336b9d23aaf61338668b45e8f71cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T18:22:50Z","email":"citadel@Citadels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T18:22:50Z","email":"citadel@Citadels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Smooth road rendering: non-linear projection + image smoothing\n\nReplace integer n-step projection loop with fractional steps (0.15\nnear player, growing to 3.0 far away) to eliminate blocky close-range\nroad strips. Enable bilinear sprite smoothing for retro-modern blend.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"411e9ab40ccdd7c5f04811b3277d2021dc840c33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/411e9ab40ccdd7c5f04811b3277d2021dc840c33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/19e25f76e25336b9d23aaf61338668b45e8f71cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/19e25f76e25336b9d23aaf61338668b45e8f71cf","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDE5ZTI1Zjc2ZTI1MzM2YjlkMjNhYWY2MTMzODY2OGI0NWU4ZjcxY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/b39341bf14b748bfdcab541a6e717b7a9143b0bc","sha":"b39341bf14b748bfdcab541a6e717b7a9143b0bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/b39341bf14b748bfdcab541a6e717b7a9143b0bc"}],"sha":"19e25f76e25336b9d23aaf61338668b45e8f71cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/19e25f76e25336b9d23aaf61338668b45e8f71cf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/b39341bf14b748bfdcab541a6e717b7a9143b0bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T18:11:48Z","email":"citadel@Citadels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T18:11:48Z","email":"citadel@Citadels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Fix traffic flicker — correct relative zFrac; tighten sprite size\n\nzFrac was computed from absolute tc.z instead of distance relative\nto playerZ. When player is mid-segment the two values diverge,\ncausing interpolation to snap. Now uses (tc.z - playerZ) % 1.\n\nAlso reduced traffic car width multiplier 0.46→0.38 / cap 0.28→0.22\nso sprites stay within their lane at close range.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0717fcac8b914693b9b49162d9fa7cd3f33714d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/0717fcac8b914693b9b49162d9fa7cd3f33714d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/b39341bf14b748bfdcab541a6e717b7a9143b0bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/b39341bf14b748bfdcab541a6e717b7a9143b0bc","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKGIzOTM0MWJmMTRiNzQ4YmZkY2FiNTQxYTZlNzE3YjdhOTE0M2IwYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/086a9ecc6935551b8e23374f387b80f14680f3ce","sha":"086a9ecc6935551b8e23374f387b80f14680f3ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/086a9ecc6935551b8e23374f387b80f14680f3ce"}],"sha":"b39341bf14b748bfdcab541a6e717b7a9143b0bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/b39341bf14b748bfdcab541a6e717b7a9143b0bc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/086a9ecc6935551b8e23374f387b80f14680f3ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T18:00:01Z","email":"citadel@Citadels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T18:00:01Z","email":"citadel@Citadels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Fix transparent traffic and buildings on road\n\nRemoved globalAlpha fade that was making close traffic see-through.\nScoped lane clamp and multiplier to car sprites only — scenery uses\nthe original formula so buildings/cacti stay off the road.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c677d9fddcec2248bccb81adabdbfa38c6bc325","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/0c677d9fddcec2248bccb81adabdbfa38c6bc325"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/086a9ecc6935551b8e23374f387b80f14680f3ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/086a9ecc6935551b8e23374f387b80f14680f3ce","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDA4NmE5ZWNjNjkzNTU1MWI4ZTIzMzc0ZjM4N2I4MGYxNDY4MGYzY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/8f67abba2533efd1b9eb4628fcecd3553c419a93","sha":"8f67abba2533efd1b9eb4628fcecd3553c419a93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/8f67abba2533efd1b9eb4628fcecd3553c419a93"}],"sha":"086a9ecc6935551b8e23374f387b80f14680f3ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/086a9ecc6935551b8e23374f387b80f14680f3ce"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/8f67abba2533efd1b9eb4628fcecd3553c419a93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:57:34Z","email":"citadel@Citadels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:57:34Z","email":"citadel@Citadels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Fix traffic sprite flickering with sub-segment interpolation\n\nTraffic cars now store their fractional z position (zFrac) when placed\ninto segments. The renderer interpolates screenY, roadW and midX between\nadjacent segments using zFrac, eliminating the segment-boundary snapping\nthat caused flickering at close range.\n\nAlso: tighter lane multiplier (0.62) and position clamp keep cars within\nroad boundaries; smooth alpha fade replaces hard n<3 cut-off.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"99ca31c6503b3e9c962bc288f6740babd0cdfae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/99ca31c6503b3e9c962bc288f6740babd0cdfae2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/8f67abba2533efd1b9eb4628fcecd3553c419a93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/8f67abba2533efd1b9eb4628fcecd3553c419a93","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDhmNjdhYmJhMjUzM2VmZDFiOWViNDYyOGZjZWNkMzU1M2M0MTlhOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/4cec6764fb338922db882c254d9be48adce88757","sha":"4cec6764fb338922db882c254d9be48adce88757","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/4cec6764fb338922db882c254d9be48adce88757"}],"sha":"8f67abba2533efd1b9eb4628fcecd3553c419a93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/8f67abba2533efd1b9eb4628fcecd3553c419a93"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/4cec6764fb338922db882c254d9be48adce88757/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:44:55Z","email":"citadel@Citadels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:44:55Z","email":"citadel@Citadels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Speed rebalance, faster traffic, smoother framerate\n\nCars: all top speeds raised to 85–165 mph range (Raptor 85, GX470 90,\nGX460 95, CLS550 100, SL550 110, Ferrari 125, Cobra 165).\n\nTraffic: speeds now in real mph units (trucks 70-80, off-road 78-90,\ncomfort 85-98, sport 95-120). Movement multiplier 45→90 to match\nplayer scale — no more traffic appearing parked.\n\nOvertake avoidance: faster traffic smoothly steers around the player\ninstead of rear-ending. Collision check skips traffic approaching\nfrom behind.\n\nPerformance: canvas DPR 4→2 (4x fewer pixels per frame), dt cap\n50ms→33ms for smoother motion interpolation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5bd69be6bad59b9e105fc3c5576d7809e59be767","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/5bd69be6bad59b9e105fc3c5576d7809e59be767"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/4cec6764fb338922db882c254d9be48adce88757","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/4cec6764fb338922db882c254d9be48adce88757","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDRjZWM2NzY0ZmIzMzg5MjJkYjg4MmMyNTRkOWJlNDhhZGNlODg3NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/5479016d00e5e73ffc2e4a97bd6566b60e396ca1","sha":"5479016d00e5e73ffc2e4a97bd6566b60e396ca1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/5479016d00e5e73ffc2e4a97bd6566b60e396ca1"}],"sha":"4cec6764fb338922db882c254d9be48adce88757","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/4cec6764fb338922db882c254d9be48adce88757"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/5479016d00e5e73ffc2e4a97bd6566b60e396ca1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T01:39:40Z","email":"citadel@Mac.lan","name":"Citadel AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T01:39:40Z","email":"citadel@Mac.lan","name":"Citadel AI"},"message":"Add spacing between hero image and car name\n\n8px margin-top on .car-name separates it from the preview canvas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7cdfc79849194a327a70654a57e6adb62cbd9cee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/trees/7cdfc79849194a327a70654a57e6adb62cbd9cee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/git/commits/5479016d00e5e73ffc2e4a97bd6566b60e396ca1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/5479016d00e5e73ffc2e4a97bd6566b60e396ca1","node_id":"C_kwDOR-mehdoAKDU0NzkwMTZkMDBlNWU3M2ZmYzJlNGE5N2JkNjU2NmI2MGUzOTZjYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commit/235a32238e9b07f07335a3675893cfbeb47f43fb","sha":"235a32238e9b07f07335a3675893cfbeb47f43fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/235a32238e9b07f07335a3675893cfbeb47f43fb"}],"sha":"5479016d00e5e73ffc2e4a97bd6566b60e396ca1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CitadelAI-Atlas/valmont-racing/commits/5479016d00e5e73ffc2e4a