5"},"message":"feat: initial Angular 19 micro-frontend setup for QuizArena\n\n- Shell host con Native Federation (puerto 4200)\n- mfe-home: pantalla Home — crear/unirse sala (puerto 4201)\n- mfe-game: Lobby + Juego + RondaResult + Podio (puerto 4202)\n- mfe-leaderboard: Leaderboard global (puerto 4203)\n- Librería compartida @qa/shared: protocol.ts, GameStateService (Signals), WebSocketService (RxJS)\n- PWA: manifest.webmanifest + ngsw service worker (instalable en Android/iOS/desktop)\n- Diseño glassmorphism dark theme con Tailwind + colores oklch\n- Infraestructura Terraform: S3 + CloudFront (HTTPS gratis sin dominio propio)\n- CI/CD: GitHub Actions build + deploy a S3 + CloudFront invalidation","tree":{"sha":"71cfdfc08a53b637acda6f22e6254217ad83090c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maybe25/project-quiz-arena-front/git/trees/71cfdfc08a53b637acda6f22e6254217ad83090c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Maybe25/project-quiz-arena-front/git/commits/7cd1ff12141b4f4e74ab2af35ce7de4a2e04c4ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49897239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maybe25/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maybe25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maybe25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maybe25/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Maybe25","id":49897239,"login":"Maybe25","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODk3MjM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maybe25/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maybe25/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maybe25/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maybe25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Maybe25/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gith