,"name":"Herklos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T09:12:19Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"message":"release: 0.12.0 — migrate components to primitives, extract BottomSheet primitive\n\nWidgets under components/ hand-rolled raw react-native-css primitives instead\nof consuming the design-system primitives/ layer. Migrate buttons to the\nnative Button primitive, cards/badges to Card/Badge, inputs/toggles to native\nInput/Switch/Checkbox, and remaining touchables to the shared Pressable.\nAlso promote SheetShell (wrongly living under components/sheets/) into a real\nBottomSheet primitive and remove the Sheet export.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23a2a8518352bc6ab28ea0c8fec7101306857a74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/trees/23a2a8518352bc6ab28ea0c8fec7101306857a74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/commits/c17263ce2ba1d9db31cc1952691050d062085d5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10454670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Herklos","id":10454670,"login":"Herklos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDU0Njcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gi