a86462c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commits/09df862b716fbe8d4011c045d44fad6e3a86462c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10454670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Herklos","id":10454670,"login":"Herklos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDU0Njcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commits/621a59003cfa70f5e92dfac68a4c4785ab403a2d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T11:47:28Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T11:48:24Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"message":"feat(sheets): export public Sheet primitive; restore SheetShell to source\n\n- Create SheetShell — cross-platform bottom-sheet shell that branches\n  web → RN Modal (gorhom does not present on react-native-web) and\n  native → @gorhom/bottom-sheet BottomSheetModal.\n- Refactor ConfirmSheet, RenameSheet, DatePickerModal, TimePickerModal\n  to wrap their content in SheetShell instead of repeating BottomSheetModal\n  boilerplate — no behaviour change on native, web now works correctly.\n- Export SheetShell as Sheet from ./components so consuming apps can build\n  custom sheet content 