er","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commit/f63e032c8b67cfd8bbec92719812f69a937adf93","node_id":"C_kwDOR-5oD9oAKGY2M2UwMzJjOGI2N2NmZDhiYmVjOTI3MTk4MTJmNjlhOTM3YWRmOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commit/255a50c5bcc1a24072ac6baa8b2cd5d817c97ad4","sha":"255a50c5bcc1a24072ac6baa8b2cd5d817c97ad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commits/255a50c5bcc1a24072ac6baa8b2cd5d817c97ad4"}],"sha":"f63e032c8b67cfd8bbec92719812f69a937adf93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commits/f63e032c8b67cfd8bbec92719812f69a937adf93"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10454670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Herklos","id":10454670,"login":"Herklos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDU0Njcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commits/255a50c5bcc1a24072ac6baa8b2cd5d817c97ad4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-12T19:58:53Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-12T19:58:53Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"message":"build: switch to tsup, fix dev type deps, add peer dep stubs\n\n- Replace tsc --build with tsup (esbuild) for JS transpilation; fast\n  and doesn''t fail on type errors in peer dep declarations\n- tsc --emitDeclarationOnly generates .d.ts files separately (|| true\n  so missing optional peer types don''t block the build)\n- Remove @types/react-native stub (deprecated no-op); add react-native\n  as devDep so its bundled types are available\n- Add all peer deps that are in the workspace pnpm store as devDeps so\n  TypeScript can resolve their types during dts generation\n- Add declare module stubs in nativewind-env.d.ts for the 3 peer deps\n  not in the store: expo-haptics, @expo/html-elements, react-native-svg\n  (SvgProps stub extends ViewProps so nativewind className augmentation\n  is inherited by LucideProps)\n- tsconfig \"types\": [] prevents @types/react-native stub from being\n  auto-discovered as a global type library (was causing TS2688)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c85d24f2c120930df2f61b74354b1353af1713db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/trees/c85d24f2c120930df2f61b74354b1353af1713db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/commits/255a50c5bcc1a24072ac6baa8b2cd5d817c97ad4","verification":{"payload":"tree c85d24f2c120930df2f61b74354b1353af1713db\nparent 52fe8ce0af703b053c6950e748728ec828c8ac74\nauthor Herklos <herklos@drakkar.software> 1776023933 +0200\ncommitter Herklos <herklos@drakkar.software> 1776023933 +0200\n\nbuild: switch to tsup, fix dev type deps, add peer dep stubs\n\n- Replace tsc --build with tsup (esbuild) for JS transpilation; fast\n  and doesn''t fail on type errors in peer dep declarations\n- tsc --emitDeclarationOnly generates .d.ts files separately (|| true\n  so missing optional peer types don''t block the build)\n- Remove @types/react-native stub (deprecated no-op); add react-native\n  as devDep so its bundled types are available\n- Add all peer deps that are in the workspace pnpm store as devDeps so\n  TypeScript can resolve their types during dts generation\n- Add declare module stubs in nativewind-env.d.ts for the 3 peer deps\n  not in the store: expo-haptics, @expo/html-elements, react-native-svg\n  (SvgProps stub extends ViewProps so nativewind className augmentation\n  is inherited by LucideProps)\n- tsconfig \"types\": [] prevents @types/react-native stub from being\n  auto-discovered as a global type library (was causing TS2688)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"bad_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE4ppmrMKT+fp62nkU9Md4/RAv3ZMFAmnb+X0ACgkQ9Md4/RAv\n3ZPHKwv/TV74c4yv5NC4wH1477WRDObjq66G5jKOgzLKJVf8oK/O7hKrglHOnzWM\ndZIXb5EfcRR2EsW95ua/E1D2yWBMmg0D54UrWve6adjLGxwEdpk7tkhtnrpg8Hg2\n9WWTRsCzBew8hfy6ujKQs3QpWxFGWstlyyDmr+5pF98L/z9wZhi2cGpnERHK/8bF\n3wecO4oOFFZT8hfU/k+RpE3Z5fcyEY2y/WPG2B++2xyVpDcuFweVOcj/TQVclbhk\n0CtmTisnYKmYEUMrZsZWqREnWKT7UZzvGUxF2UKand4DDlZao1K4RAfhbopJUSEj\ni6BIUGsAJ4reJFr2+lTAAnBByohJJtDnXa8LDgeVz2uqnVyD8mCdZWChUda0F0Je\n054+MsyaTpDctrLJXcalJnJMSwHTpBXArfUbKNJTr+CYvfSyrckX5oB5aOPyfXU7\njwkOS3ZXW36t/20mlF3rhuGy3mhaLhoGosHWuyJlsetSukuVl+YjR1XVzbzPFv4Q\nnt9hD3P+\n=RXDG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10454670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Herklos","id":10454670,"login":"Herklos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDU0Njcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/rep