,"email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-12T19:39:50Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"message":"fix(tailwind-theme): add @source inline for all internal utility classes\n\nSeaHorse primitives use Tailwind utility classes (bg-primary-600, etc.)\nthat consuming apps may never reference in their own source. Tailwind''s\nscanner skips node_modules by default, so these classes were silently\nomitted from the CSS output — causing transparent Avatar backgrounds,\nmissing button colors, and other invisible styles.\n\n@source inline(...) directives in tailwind-theme.css force-generate all\nclasses SeaHorse uses internally. Any app that already imports\n@drakkar.software/seahorse/tailwind-theme gets the fix automatically,\nwith no changes needed on the app side.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad24fb852b9eebb71c2cb335199b3da76a2b18db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/trees/ad24fb852b9eebb71c2cb335199b3da76a2b18db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/commits/52fe8ce0af703b053c6950e748728ec828c8ac74","verification":{"payload":"tree ad24fb852b9eebb71c2cb335199b3da76a2b18db\nparent 37042cc4d9efba397feba22805f83677533d972e\nauthor Herklos <herklos@drakkar.software> 1776022790 +0200\ncommitter Herklos <herklos@drakkar.software> 1776022790 +0200\n\nfix(tailwind-theme): add @source inline for all internal utility classes\n\nSeaHorse primitives use Tailwind utility classes (bg-primary-600, etc.)\nthat consuming apps may never reference in their own source. Tailwind''s\nscanner skips node_modules by default, so these classes were silently\nomitted from the CSS output — causing transparent Avatar backgrounds,\nmissing button colors, and other invisible styles.\n\n@source inline(...) directives in tailwind-theme.css force-generate all\nclasses SeaHorse uses internally. Any app that already imports\n@drakkar.software/seahorse/tailwind-theme gets the fix automatically,\nwith no changes needed on the app side.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"bad_email","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE4ppmrMKT+fp62nkU9Md4/RAv3ZMFAmnb9QYACgkQ9Md4/RAv\n3ZPtKwwAi0nrDAjIseeGnKwWLJwoPMPSjmUnP49cFEGV6AxSIbcHVqvK2f/hDhWK\n5+b1wLHiBj7CqHnstVCzZq1f+2GP9zePxlO1YfJ97x0QixMunrdEuzBPA7Z54vQO\ntRR+x8grhzEhXpFky0kOUB4nnh8TGePS0gS7fRgrEcdGMIdzcqoLeAI6kKeFzva2\nX9U6E3UFAvl+0WMbWgJstvmimBWI2oeM8nApA3GFaY1JDubx9DwNmtWUi2VU72JN\n6cNcjDXI39zGzXxMEBl5klyqC31JPyuv9kh19JpZM1zl137/3Pe8nF0uEtqjrB/i\nnS3vMd/YoIP2SzQRRsKkImFyvOKipmwfvlkYwh0NUSksbjLVaNaYkBtaWLCDjilI\nJuLr8TyQBrDXBn2bikFsrFZRZw190ane5ILzRNA/BLnIPSx/zjiIbgJgvOn2bSOJ\n6lLeh1HCbaF9lmHLxoltsRjkpLr1WjByl1FXCZV/zpYPVpSAaa6Hr04XL2iNxc8S\n/JBWeihG\n=uZTx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10454670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Herklos","id":10454670,"login":"Herklos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDU0Njcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commit/52fe8ce0af703b053c6950e748728ec828c8ac74","node_id":"C_kwDOR-5oD9oAKDUyZmU4Y2UwYWY