rse/commits/da2dc665268722da81e1015ccdb48341248704e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T20:32:30Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T20:32:30Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"message":"feat: add semantic HTML primitives, FeatureCard, and usePageMeta hook\n\n- 5 new layout primitives: Section, Nav, Footer, Main, Anchor — each\n  with a native variant (via @expo/html-elements + cssInterop) and a\n  web variant rendering the correct semantic HTML tag\n- FeatureCard component: icon + title + description + optional CTA,\n  follows the IconCard/StatCard pattern\n- usePageMeta hook: sets document.title, meta description, OG tags,\n  canonical URL, and hreflang per-page on web (no-op on native)\n- Wire all new exports into barrel files and package.json subpath exports\n- Bump version to 0.7.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"501cf3fa85e307f8363e323bc2ab14739db7196f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/trees/501cf3fa85e307f8363e323bc2ab14739db7196f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/commits/da2dc665268722da81e1015ccdb48341248704e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10454670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Herklos","id":10454670,"login":"Herklos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDU0Njcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/received_events","repos_url":"https: