"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Herklos","id":10454670,"login":"Herklos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDU0Njcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commits/db939cbb447267955c6bb707d5985352ab9bd57d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T15:53:21Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T15:53:21Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"message":"fix: use resolveRequest with originModulePath override for singleton packages\n\nextraNodeModules is a fallback — Metro still finds packages/seahorse/node_modules\nfirst. require.resolve is wrong because it ignores Metro platform extensions and\nthe react-native package.json field.\n\nCorrect approach: intercept singleton package imports in resolveRequest and\nre-invoke context.resolveRequest with originModulePath pointing into projectRoot.\nMetro''s own resolver (with react-native field, platform extensions, etc.) then\ndoes a normal directory walk starting from the app root and picks up the single\nshared copy in example/node_modules.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c7daca185305e0e749cae6e103e8755f84d3cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/trees/6c7daca185305e0e749cae6e103e8755f84d3cc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/commits/db939cbb447267955c6bb707d5985352ab9bd57d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10454670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Herklos","id":10454670,"login":"Herklos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDU0Njcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commit/db939cbb447267955c6bb707d5985352ab9bd57d","node_id":"C_kwDOR-5oD9oAKGRiOTM5Y2JiNDQ3MjY3OTU1YzZiYjcwN2Q1OTg1MzUyYWI5YmQ1N2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commit/d9fe62be3d905558d7f76dc6c581661192b1db82","sha":"d9fe62be3d905558d7f76dc6c581661192b1db82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commits/d9fe62be3d905558d7f76dc6c581661192b1db82"}],"sha":"db939cbb447267955c6bb707d5985352ab9bd57d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commits/db939cbb447267955c6bb707d5985352ab9bd57d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10454670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Herklos","id":10454670,"login":"Herklos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNDU0Njcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commits/d9fe62be3d905558d7f76dc6c581661192b1db82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T15:49:43Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T15:49:43Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"message":"fix: force singleton packages to app''s node_modules in Metro resolver\n\npnpm resolves peer deps per-package, giving the seahorse library its own\ncopy of @gorhom/bottom-sheet (and react, react-native, reanimated, etc.)\nin packages/seahorse/node_modules/. Metro would resolve these from the\nlibrary tree first, creating a separate module instance from the one the\nexample app uses. BottomSheetModalProvider creates context on the app''s\ninstance, but BottomSheetModal inside the library reads from its own\ninstance — always null.\n\nextraNodeModules forces all singleton packages to the app''s copies,\nensuring one shared module instance for all context-sensitive packages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"821d3db5d1bb072174db88d3abe7ce31da60f071","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/trees/821d3db5d1bb072174db88d3abe7ce31da60f071"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software