os/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commits/34ffd56512e175d5c209cf6ae48a7dcc02d59b0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T13:41:33Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T13:41:33Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"message":"feat: add primitives layer with 37 components and utility hooks (v0.4.0)\n\n- ./primitives subpath export: Box, HStack/VStack, Center, Text, Heading,\n  Icon, Pressable, Image, Divider (layout & typography)\n- Button/Input/Textarea/Checkbox/Radio/Switch/Slider/Select/FormControl/Spinner\n  (form controls)\n- Modal, AlertDialog, Alert, Badge, Avatar, Skeleton, Card, NotificationDot,\n  Toast + useToast (feedback & display)\n- useBreakpointValue, lightHaptic/mediumHaptic, useDebounce utility hooks\n- Add @legendapp/motion optional peer dep (Toast animations)\n- Fix tailwind-theme export: add \"style\" condition for TW v4 @import resolver\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d33125474a30b441271635e80a115ddd2c2afd9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/trees/d33125474a30b441271635e80a115ddd2c2afd9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/commits/34ffd56512e175d5c209cf6ae48a7dcc02d59b0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10454670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/gists{/gist_i