los/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/commits/681db1f369aa129b76615e3a10ec304602824af5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T10:51:50Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T10:51:50Z","email":"herklos@drakkar.software","name":"Herklos"},"message":"feat: upgrade to NativeWind v5 + Tailwind CSS v4, add semantic token system (v0.2.0)\n\nBreaking: Requires NativeWind v5 + Tailwind CSS v4. Min React 19, React Native 0.83.\n\n- Remove jsxImportSource nativewind (NW v5 uses Babel transform, not JSX runtime)\n- Add tailwind/theme.css — full semantic CSS custom property token system\n- Add utils/cn — clsx + tailwind-merge utility\n- Migrate all 26 components from hardcoded gray/red classes to semantic tokens\n- Extend FilterTabs with icon? and hidden? props\n- Update example app to TW v4 CSS-based config\n- Add clsx + tailwind-merge as direct dependencies\n- Bump peer deps: nativewind >=5.0.0-0, react >=19, react-native >=0.83\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bf45f1579044e652398d98dc6a42715afbdbb8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/trees/1bf45f1579044e652398d98dc6a42715afbdbb8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Drakkar-Software/SeaHorse/git/commits/681db1f369aa129b76615e3a10ec304602824af5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10454670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Herklos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://